<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 CAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk mukwongo pa Camuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Camuel</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Cam</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk mukwongo pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">CAMUEL</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk mukwongo pa Camuel nyutu kamaleng kit ma jo Icrael gua kwede ki i loc pa lungolkop nio kwede wa i loc pa luker. Alokaloka man otime ikare me kwo pa dano adek. Gin aye Camuel ma obedo langolkop madit ma ogiko, Caulo ma obedo rwot ma okwongo ki dong Daudi ma kwone obedo kawire ikin Camuel ki Caulo, ma peya en odoko rwot.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wi lok madit ma i buk man rom aroma ki matye i buk mukene matye i buk me Cik Macon. En aye ni bedo lagen bot Lubanga kelo gum madit ento kwero winyo lok pa Lubanga kelo can keken. Man okati kamaleng ki i dog Lubanga ma oloko bot Eli ni, “Pien jo ma giketo deyo ikoma an bene abiketo deyo ikomgi, ento jo ma gin caya pe abiketo cwinya ikomgi” (1 Cam 2:30).</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man okati ki tam ma pat ma jo Icrael gumito pi bedo ki rwot ma dano maka Rwot Lubanga. Lubanga kono kikome aye onongo kare ducu obedo Rwot pa jo Icrael, ento pi miti pa jo Icrael, Lubanga omiyo botgi rwot.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok ma pire dit adada en aye ni rwot ki jo Icrael ducu gitye ite twero pa Lubanga (1 Cam 2:7-10). Ite Cik pa Lubanga twero pa dano ducu myero kiwor kadi bed dano meno obed lalonyo onyo lacan myero kigwok maber.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Camuel macalo langolkop pa jo Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 1:1-7:17">1:1—7:17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Caulo odoko rwot mukwongo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 8:1-10:27">8:1—10:27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Acaki loc pa Caulo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 11:1-15:35">11:1—15:35</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Daudi ki Caulo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 16:1-30:31">16:1—30:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">To pa Caulo ki awobene <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">31:1-13</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nywalo Camuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Yam tye dano mo i Ramataim ma i lobo godi me Epraim ma nyinge Elkana wod pa Jerokam, ma wod pa Eliu wod pa Toku, ma en aye wod pa Jupi ma jo Epraim. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Onongo tye ki mon aryo; nying ngat acel Anna, ki nying dako mukene Penina. Penina onongo tye ki lutino, ento Anna onongo lutinone peke.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Dano man yam a ki i taun me Ramataim mwaka ki mwaka ci cito ka woro Rwot me mony ki ka tyero gitum i Cilo, kama onongo tye iye awobe pa Eli aryo, Kopuni ki Finekaci, ma gin ajwaki pa Rwot. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Inino ma Elkana tyero iye gitume, en miyo dul ringo bot dakone Penina ki bot awobene ki anyirane ducu. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Ento kadi bed en maro Anna mada en obedo kamiyo bote dul acel keken, pien Rwot onongo otweyo iye woko, ma pe nywal. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Nyeke obedo ka ngeto iye marac ki cwero cwinye, pien Rwot otweyo iye woko, ma pe nywal. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Kit tim meno obedo ka time mwaka ki mwaka; ikare ducu ma Anna cito kunu i Ot pa Rwot, nyeke bedo ka ngeto iye. Man omiyo Anna bedo kakoko, ma pe camo. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Inino mo acel cware Elkana openye ni, “Anna, ikok pingo? Pingo pe icamo? Cwinyi cwer pingo? An pe ayomo cwinyi makato awobe apar?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Ka dong gutyeko camo cam ki mat i Cilo, ci Anna oa malo. Ikare meno onongo ajwaka Eli obedo iwi kome inget okar dogola me Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Anna onongo cwinye cwer matek, ci ocako lego Rwot kun kok matek tutwal. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:5">Wel 6:5</ref></char></note>Okwongo kwong kun waco ni, “Ai Rwot me mony, kace ibineno aroma ma an angecani atye kwede, kun ipoo pira, ma wii pe wil ikoma, ce imiya latin laco ci abidyero en i cingi Rwot pi kare me kwone ducu, en pe bimato kongo bwino nyo gin mo ma kec, dok lyedi mo bene pe bigudo wiye.”<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Ka Anna pud omede ki lega inyim Rwot, ci Eli obedo kaneno del doge. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Anna obedo kalega ki i cwinye, kun del doge aye yenge, ento dwone pe winye; ma omiyo Eli otamo ni en obedo dako ma lamero. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Ci Eli owaco bote ni, “Ibimer pi kare marom mene? Juk mero ki kongo bwinoni ni woko.”<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Ento Anna odok iye ni, “Pe kumeno, rwoda. An a dako ma cwercwiny aye obwoyo koma woko. Pe amato kongo bwino nyo gin ma mero dano, ento abedo kayako pekona woko inyim Rwot. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Pe iloka abed dako ma kite tye atata. Pien gin ma abedo ka lokone ni ducu dwonge para ki cwercwinya.” <verse eid="1SA 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Ci Eli odok iye ni, “Wot ki kuc. Lubanga pa Icrael omyero oye legani ma ikelo boteni.” <verse eid="1SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Anna ogamo ni, “Wek gum okaya inyimi, ladit.” Ka okato ocito woko, ocako cam, ci cwercwinye ogik.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Gupuk odiko con, gucito ka woro Rwot; ka lacen gudok paco tugi i Rama. Elkana obutu ki dakone Anna, ci Rwot ogamo lega pa Anna. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Anna ogamo iye. Ka kare oromo, onywalo latin laco. Anna ocako nyinge Camuel, pien owaco ni, “Alego alega ki bot Rwot.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Elkana ki jo ma i ode ducu dok gucito ka tyero gitum me mwaka bot Rwot, ki pi cobo kwonge. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Ento Anna pe ocito. Owaco bot cware ni, “Ka latin dong obwoto doto cak, ci abitere, wek en obed inyim Rwot, dong kunu matwal.” <verse eid="1SA 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Cware Elkana ogamo ni, “Tim gin ma ineno ni ber; kong dong ikur wang ma obwoto dot. Ento Rwot aye myero okonyi wek i ocob loki kakare.” Ci Anna odong ka doto latine, nio ka latin oweko doto cak.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Ka dong wode obwoto dot ci otere, kacel ki twon ma dite romo mwaka adek, ki moko kwon maromo debe aryo, ki opiru kongo bwino, ci okele i Ot pa Rwot ma i Cilo, kun onongo latin pud tidi. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Guneko twon, ka gutero latin bot Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Ci Anna owaco bote ni, “A rwoda, tika ipo ikoma? An aye a dako mayam ocung inyimi kany kun alego Rwoti. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Yam alego pi latin man, ci Rwot oye legana ma akok kwede bote. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Ma omiyo an dong adyero en woko i cing Rwot me bedo latice pi kare me kwone ducu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 1:28">Ci guworo Rwot kunu.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lega pa Anna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:46-55">Luk 1:46-55</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Anna olego bene kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">“Aum ki yomcwiny pi Rwot; teka omede woko pi Rwot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Doga nyedo lok ikom lumeroka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">cwinya yom pien in Rwot ilara.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Pe tye ngati mo maleng macalo Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:2">ngat mo peke, kono in keken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:2">lagwok mo peke marom ki Lubangawa.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Pe wumede kalok ki wake tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">pe lok me nyate okati ki i dogwu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">pien Rwot aye Lubanga won ngec,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">en pimo gin ducu ma dano timo.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Atum pa twoni dong kituru woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:4">ento jo magoro gudoko lutekkom.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Jo mayam giyeng gudoko lutic me nongo cam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">ento kec dong peke bot jo mayam kec nekogi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Lalur onywalo lutino abiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">ento megi awobe mapol dong odoko goro.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Rwot neko dano dok cero woko bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:6">tero i lyel dok dwoko makwo.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Rwot miyo can, dok miyo lonyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:7">en lanyo dano, dok pilo wiye.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />En ilo lucan woko ki i apwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">dok tingo jo ma piny obwoyogi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">kwanyogi woko ki iwi odur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">wek gubed kacel ki rwodi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">gunong kabedo me woro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Rwot aye won wir ma teno lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">ma ocibo lobo ocung iwigi.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Rwot bigwoko tyen jone ma gene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">ento lutim aranyi gibirido wigi woko i piny macol;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">pien dano pe loyo lweny pi tek kome.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Lulweny ikom Rwot kibinginyogi woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">en bimor ikomgi ki i polo macalo mor kot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Rwot bingolo kop wa i agiki lobo ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">en bimiyo kero bot rwote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">dok miyo tek bot lakere ma ki wiro ki moo.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Ka Elkana odok i gange i Rama, latin odong katic bot Rwot ite loc pa ajwaka Eli.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awobe pa Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Onongo awobe pa Eli kitgi racu; pe giparo pi Rwot wa ki acel <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />kadi wa pi tic mayam ajwaki gitiyo kwede ikom lwak. Ikare meno onongo tye kit man, ka dano mo otyero gitum, ci latic pa ajwaka bino ma pud gitye katedo ringo, ma omako lacob ringo ma lake okare adek. <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />Ci rwako i otako, nyo i atabo, nyo i cupuriya, nyo i agulu. Ringo ducu ma lacob ringo ocobo okelo woko bedo pa ajwaka. Yam gubedo katimo kitmeno i Cilo ikom jo Icrael ducu ma gibino iye. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Dok bene latic pa ajwaka pa Lubanga yam bino ma moo dwolo peya kiwango, ci waco bot dano ma tyero gitume ni, “Mii ringo bot ajwaka me abula, pien en pe ye gamo ringo ma dong kitedo, kono ma numone keken.” <verse eid="1SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Kace dano meno owace ni, “Kong iwek kiwang dwolo, ka dong ikwany madit kit ma imitoni,” ci latic gamo ni, “Pe kumeno; myero imii kombedi. Ka pe, ci abikwanyo ki tek.” <verse eid="1SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Kitmeno bal pa awobe meno obedo dit tutwal inyim Rwot, pien jo meno gubedo kacayo gityer pa Rwot acaya.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Camuel obedo katic inyim Rwot ma onongo pud tidi, kun tweyo epod bongo camanini i pyere. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Mine kwoyo kanyi matidi mwaka ki mwaka ci tero bote ka en cito kacel ki cware katyero gitum me mwaka. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Ci Eli lego gum ikom Elkana ki dakone kun waco ni, “Lubanga omii inong lutino ki ikom dako man ma ka latin ma en odyero bot Rwoti”; ka lacen gidok paco tugi.<verse eid="1SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Rwot omiyo gum ikom Anna ci Anna, onywalo lutino awobe adek ki anyira aryo. Ci latin man Camuel odongo i tic pa Rwot.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Ikare meno onongo Eli dong otii mada. Obedo kawinyo kit ma awobene tiyo kwede ikom jo Icrael ducu, ki kit ma gibutu ki mon ma gitiyo i dogola Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Eli owaco botgi ni, “Pingo wutimo gin macalo meno? Pien abedo kawinyo ki bot lwak ducu pi gin maracu ma wutimo. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Pe kumeno, lutinona; lok ma awinyo ikomwu ma lwak pa Rwot gunyayo oromo pinyi pe ber. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Ka dano mo obalo ikom dano wadi, ci Lubanga biteko kin gi. Ento ka dano obalo ikom Rwot, anga matwero bako doge pire?” Ento gin yam pe guworo dog won gi, pien onongo Rwot mito ni enekgi woko.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 2:52">Luk 2:52</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci latin man Camuel omede ki dongo, kun yomo cwiny Rwot ki cwiny dano bene.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Dano pa Lubanga mo obino bot Eli, owaco bote ni, “Rwot owaco kit man ni, ‘Yam anyute kekena bot kwaru Aron ikare ma gitye i Ejipt, ma gubedo opii i ot pa Parao. <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1-4">Nia 28:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:35-36">Lev 7:35-36</ref></char></note>Yam ayero en ki ikin kakawu ducu ma i Icrael wek obed ajwakana, dok ocit cok ki keno tyera, obed kawango odok eceta, ki ruku epod inyima. Ci yam amiyo bot jo me ot pa kwaru gityer ducu pa jo Icrael ma kiwango ki mac. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Pingo dok wucayo gituma ki gityera mayam aciko? Dok pingo iworo lutinoni makato an, pi weko gicwe ki dul mabeco tutwal ki ikom gityer ducu ma jona, jo Icrael gityero.’ <verse eid="1SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />Pimeno Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael otucu atyer ni, ‘Yam aciko ni, jo me odi ki jo me ot pa kwaru gin bimede katiyo ticgi inyima matwal’; ento kombedi Rwot otucu atyer ni lok me cike meno pire oboti woko ki bota, pien jo ma giketo deyo ikoma an bene abiketo deyo ikomgi, ento jo ma gicaya pe abiketo cwinya ikomgi. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Nen, kare bibino ma abituru iye teki woko ki tek me ot pa kwaru, wek dano mo ma otii pe obed i odi. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Ka can dong opoto ikomi, nyeko bimaki ikom jo Icrael pi lonyo ducu ma gibinongo, kun dano mo ma otii pe bibedo i odi matwal. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Danoni mo ma abiweko dong inget keno tyera, wange bicor woko ki koko, kun cwinye ton; likwayowu ducu dano binekogi woko ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:11">1 Cam 4:11</ref></char></note>Gin ma bipoto ikom awobeni aryoni, Kopuni ki Finekaci, en aye bibedo lanyut boti; gin aryo ducu gibito inino acel. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Dok abiketo ajwaka ma lagen pira kena ma tice birwate ki lok matye i cwinya ki i tama. Abigero ki en ot matek atika, ci en birii i dog tice nakanaka inyim danona ma kiwiro ki moo. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Dok ka dano mo odong ki i odi, bibino kabako doge bote pi nucu lim mo, nyo kwon mo kun waco ni, ‘Tim ber, iketa i kabedo mo pa ajwaka, wek acam latin kwon mo.’”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot olwongo Camuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Ikare meno onongo Camuel tye katic pi Rwot ite loc pa Eli. Onongo lok pa Rwot bino kicelkicel keken, ginanyuta ma Rwot cwalo macalo lek pe onongo nen teretere.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Ikare meno Eli ma wange onongo dong cok ka to wokoni, ma dong pe neno piny maberi, obutu i ot butu ma mere, <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />kun mac tara pa Lubanga pud lyel, ki Camuel obutu piny i Ot pa Rwot kama Canduk me Gicike bedo iye. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Ci Rwot olwongo Camuel ni, “Camuel! Camuel!” Camuel ogamo ni, “An atye ene!” <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Ci oringo bot Eli owaco ni, “An atye ene, ibedo kalwonga.” Ento Eli ogamo ni, “An pe alwongi, dok ibut piny.” Camuel odok obutu piny. <verse eid="1SA 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Ci Rwot dok olwongo ni, “Camuel! Camuel!” Ci Camuel oa ocito bot Eli, owaco ni, “An atye ene, ibedo kalwonga.” Eli ogamo ni, “An pe alwongi, latina, dok ibut piny.” <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Ikare meno onongo Camuel peya ngeyo Rwot, onongo Rwot peya oyabo loke bote. <verse eid="1SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Ci Rwot dok olwongo Camuel tyen me adeke, ci Camuel dok oa ocito bot Eli kun waco ni, “An atye ene, ibedo kalwonga.” Ci Eli oniang ni Rwot aye obedo kalwongo awobini, <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />ma omiyo Eli owaco bot Camuel ni, “Cit ibut piny. Kace dok olwongi, ci ibiwaco ni, ‘Rwot, wac loki. An latici, atye kawinyone.’” Kitmeno Camuel odok obutu piny i kabutune.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Rwot obino ci ocung cok kun lwongo kit ma olwongo ikare ca ni, “Camuel! Camuel!” Ci Camuel ogamo ni, “Rwot, wac loki. An latici, atye kawinyone.” <figure style="fig" alt="Lord speak I am listening" file="co00707b.tif" size="col" loc="3:10" copy="David Cook" ref="3:10">Rwot, wac loki. An latici atye kawinyone</figure> <verse eid="1SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Dok Rwot owaco bot Camuel ni, “Nen ba, an dong atye cok katiyo gin mo i Icrael ma bimiyo dano ducu ma winyo komgi bito lirut. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Inino meno abicobo gin ducu mayam aloko ikom ot pa Eli, cake i acakine nio wa i agiki. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />An dong atito bote ni abiketo can ikom jo me ot pa Eli matwal pi gin ma guroco ma en ngeyo wa con, pien lutinone gubedo kayeto Lubanga kun en pe jukugi. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Ma omiyo akwongo kwong bot jo me ot pa Eli ni, pe tye gitum mo nyo gityer mo ma bikwanyo bal ki ikom jo me ot pa Eli matwal.”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Camuel obutu nio wa odiko, ci ocako yabo dogola me Ot pa Rwot. Onongo en lworo tito bot Eli lok ma Lubanga onyutu bote. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Ento Eli olwonge kun waco ni “Camuel, latina.” Camuel ogamo ni, “An atye ene.” <verse eid="1SA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Ci Eli openye ni, “Rwot otiti lok ango? Pe imunga loke. Lubanga myero oket can ikomi kitmeno ki makato bene, kace imunga lok mo ikom lok ducu ma en otito boti.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Kitmeno Camuel otite lok ducu, kun pe omungo lok mo bote. Ci Eli ogamo ni, “En aye Rwot; wek otim gin ma oneno ni ber.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Camuel omede ki dongo kun onongo Rwot tye kwede, Rwot pe oweko lok mo ma Camuel owaco obut opoto piny i ngom ma pe ocobe kakare. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Ci jo Icrael ducu cake ki i Dan nio wa i Beer-ceba gungeyo ni, Camuel dong kimoko me bedo lanebi pa Rwot. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Ci Rwot omede ki nen bot Camuel dok i Cilo, kama yam onyute iye boteni, kun tito loke bote. Ka Camuel oloko ci lwak ducu winyo loke.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Ci lok ma Camuel obedo kaloko oker oromo lobo Icrael ducu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1SA 4:1">Yako Canduk Cik</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Ikare meno jo Piliciti gucito kalweny ki jo Icrael, ci jo Icrael gutongo gony i Ebenejer, ki jo Piliciti gutongo gonygi i Apek. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Jo Piliciti gurye i tyeng kalweny ikom jo Icrael. Ka mony ogeto matek, ci jo Piliciti guloyo jo Icrael, guneko jo ma mito romo alip angwen ki i bar lweny. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Ka lumony gudwogo i gony, ludongo pa jo Icrael guwaco ni, “Pingo Rwot oye ni jo Piliciti gulowa tin? Wek wacit wakel canduk me Gicike pa Rwot ki i Cilo, wek en Rwot obin obed i dyewa, olarwa ki i cing lumerokwani.” <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Nia 25:22</ref></char></note>Ci lwak gucwalo dano i Cilo, gukelo canduk me Gicike pa Rwot me mony ki kunu, kama Rwot bedo iye iwi komkere malo ka wi lukerubini. Awobe pa Eli, Kopuni ki Finekaci, bene gubino kacel ki canduk me Gicike pa Lubanga.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Ka Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot obino i gony, jo Icrael ducu guwoo ki dange matek, omiyo lobo bene omor. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Ka jo Piliciti guwinyo woo ki dange, ci guwaco ni, “Woo man maditi ma a ki i gony pa jo Ibruni teloke ango?” Ka gungeyo ni Canduk pa Rwot otyeko bino i gony pa jo Icrael, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />ci jo Piliciti gubedo ki lworo, pien gubedo kawaco ni, “Lubangagi dong oo i gonygi.” Ci guwaco ni, “Oii, watum woko ba! Gin macalo man yam peya otime. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Oii, watum woko ba! Anga ma bilarowa ki i cing lubanga magi mateki? Meno gin aye lubanga mayam gupwodo jo Ejipt ki lwak can mapol i tim. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Wucam co, wuka lakwu matek macalo co, wun jo Piliciti, wek pe wudok opii pa jo Ibru kit ma gin gubedo kwede opiiwuni. Wuka lakwu matek macalo co, ci wulweny.”<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Kitmeno jo Piliciti gucako lweny, ci guloyo jo Icrael. Jo Icrael guringo woko, kun dano acel acel ringo laro pacone. Nek obedo dwong tutwal, pien Luicrael guto kunu maromo jo alip pyere adek ma woto ki tyen gi. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Ki Canduk me Gicike bene kiyako woko; ki awobe pa Eli aryo, Kopuni ki Finekaci, kinekogi woko bene.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">To Pa Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Dano mo ma Labenjamin oringo oa ki iwang mony, obino i Cilo inino meno kikome, ma bongine oyec woko, wiye bene ojuku ki ngom. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Ka en oo, onongo Eli obedo iwi kome inget yoo kakuru lok, pien onongo cwinye ongabe angaba pi Canduk me Gicike. Ka dano meno obino odonyo i taun, otito loke, ci taun ducu omor ki koko. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Ka Eli owinyo dwon ma mor ki kokoni, ci openyo ni, “Man woo me ngo?” Ka dano meno orune, obino otito bot Eli. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Eli onongo dong dite romo mwaka pyere abongwen wiye aboro, ki wange bene ocor woko, omiyo dong pe neno piny maber. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Dano meno owaco bot Eli ni, “An aye aa ki iwang mony, aringo aa ki i mony tin.” En ogamo ni, “Ci dong obedo ningning, latina?” <verse eid="1SA 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Lakel loki ogamo kun waco ni, “Jo Icrael guringo woko ki inyim jo Piliciti, dok bene kineko jo tuwa madwong tutwal, ki Canduk me Gicike bene kiyako woko.” <verse eid="1SA 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Ka otucu lok ikom Canduk me Gicike, ci Eli opoto ataro ki iwi kome ma obedo kwede i dog cel me gang; ci ngute otur, oto woko, pien onongo dong otii mada, dok ocwer bene mada. Eli onongo obedo langolkop i Icrael pi mwaka pyere angwen.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Ikare meno ciwod pa Eli ma dako pa Finekaci onongo iye odongo, macok nywal. Ka owinyo lok ni Canduk me Gicike dong kiyako woko, dok ni kwarone ki cware guto woko, oture piny, onywal, pien onongo mwoc ogoyo. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Ikare ma en mito to woko, mon ma gucung kangete guwaco bote ni, “Pe ilwor, pien inywalo latin awobi.” Ento en pe ogamo doggi, pe oketo iye cwinye bene. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Ci en ocako nying latin ni, Ikabod, ma te loke ni, “Deyo otyeko a woko ki i Icrael!” Pien Canduk me Gicike dong kiyako woko, ki pi kwarone ki cware ma guto wokoni. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Dok en owaco ni, “Deyo pa Lubanga oa woko ki i Icrael, pien Canduk me Gicike dong kiyako woko.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Canduk me Gicike ikin jo Piliciti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Ka jo Piliciti guyako Canduk me Gicike, gutingo ki i Ebenejer, gutero Acidod. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Ka dok jo Piliciti gukobo Canduk me Gicike, gutero i ot pa jokgi Dagon, ci gucibo ka nget cal Dagon. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Orwone ka jo Acidod gua malo odiko con, ci nen, cal Dagon tye opoto aryeba cwiny inyim Canduk pa Rwot. Ci gutingo cal Dagon, gudwoko kakare. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Ento orwone dok ka gua odiko con, ci nen, cal Dagon tye opoto aryeba inyim Canduk pa Rwot. Wi cal Dagon ki bade ryoryo ongun woko, opoto ikom larii dogola; cal Dagon odong ma kome adul. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Man aye gin ma omiyo ajwaki pa Dagon ki jo ducu ma gidonyo i ot pa Dagon pe dok ginyono larii dogola me ot pa Dagon ma i Acidod wa onyo.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Ci Rwot omiyo pwod mapek opoto ikom jo Acidod ma omiyogi lworo madwong; dok Rwot omiyogi akwota bur leba, wa ikom jo ma i lobo ma ingete ducu. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Ka jo Acidod guneno kit ma piny tye kwede, ci guwaco ni, “Canduk me Gicike pa jo Icrael pe obed ikinwa, pien Rwot omiyo pwod mapek opoto ikomwa, ki ikom Dagon ma lubangawani.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Ma omiyo gucwalo kwena, ci gucoko rwodi pa jo Piliciti ducu kacel kun gin waco ni, “Wabitimo Canduk me Gicike pa jo Icrael ningning?” Ci gudok iye ni, “Wek Canduk me Gicike pa jo Icrael giter wa i Gat.” Ci gutero Canduk me Gicike pa jo Icrael kunu. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Ento ka dong gitero kunu, ci Rwot omiyo pwod mapek opoto ikom taun madit meno, ma obango komgi woko. Ci otimo jo Gat malit, omiyo akwota bur leba ocore ikom lutino wa ki ludito. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Dok gucwalo Canduk me Gicike i Ekron. Ka Canduk me Gicike oo i Ekron, ci jo Ekron gukok matek ni, “Pingo kikelo Canduk me Gicike pa jo Icrael kany me nekowa woko wa ki rokwa ducu?” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Ci gin ocwalo lok, gucoko rwodi pa jo Piliciti ducu kacel kun giwaco ni, “Wucwal Canduk me Gicike pa jo Icrael woko, wek odok gire i kabedone, wek pe obed kanekowa kacel ki rokwa ducu.” Pien onongo to me nino ducu dong obango kom dano ma i taun madit meno ducu. Ci Rwot omiyo pwod mapek opoto kunu, <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />kun jo ma pe guto gubedo ki akwota bur leba maracu ikomgi. Ci jo me gang meno gukok pi kony bot lubangagi.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Piliciti gudwoko Canduk me Gicike kakare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Canduk pa Rwot obedo i lobo pa jo Piliciti pi dwe abiro. <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Lacen jo Piliciti gulwongo ajwaki ki lutyet ci guwaco ni, “Wabitimo Canduk pa Rwot ningning? Wutit botwa kit gin ma myero wamii ma wabidwoko kwede canduk i kabedone.” <verse eid="1SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Ci guwaco ni, “Ka wucwalo Canduk me Gicike pa jo Icrael; pe wucwal nono, ento atikane wudwok ki gitum me tingo alii. Ci dong wubicang ci weko wubiniang gin ma omiyo Rwot pe okwanyo cinge woko ki ikomwu.” <verse eid="1SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Ci gugamo ni, “Kit mot me gitum ango ma wabimiyo me gitum me tingo alii?” Gudok iye ni, “Cal jabu abic ma oporo kit akwota bur leba, ki cal oyo adeng abic muporo wel rwodi pa Lupiliciti; pien kit two gemo acelu onongo omakowu ducu, ki rwodiwu bene. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Pieno myero wutet cal akwota bur leba ki cal oyo adeng ma gitye katyeko lobowu wokoni ki bene wuket deyo ikom Lubanga pa jo Icrael; ci gwok nyo en bikwanyo cinge woko ki ikomwu, ki ikom lubangawu ki lobowu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Pe wumii cwinywu obed tek kit macalo yam jo Ejipt ki Parao cwinygi obedo tek kwede. <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Kombedi dong wukwany gadigadi manyen, ki megi dyangi aryo ma kinyetogi ma peya kitiyo kwedgi me pur, ci wutwe dyangi meno inyim gadigadi me ywayone, ento wuter lutino dyangi paco, pe gubed kacel ki megigi. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Ci wukel Canduk pa Rwot wuket iwi gadigadi, ci wuket cal jabu ma wutetoni i canduk mukene kangete, ma wubidwoko bote macalo tyer me tingo alii. Ka dong wucwal, ociti. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Ci dong wunen kore; kace cito kemo yoo macito wa i Bet-cemec, ci Lubanga pa jo Icrael aye okelo can man madit ikomwa; ento ka pe kitmeno ci miyo wangeyo ni pe cinge aye ma obedo ka pwodowa; can meno otime ikomwa pi keckom.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Jonu gutimo kitmeno; gukwanyo megi dyangi aryo ma kinyetogi, ci gutweyogi inyim gadigadi. Ka dong guloro wi lutino dyangi woko i akul. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Gucibo Canduk pa Rwot iwi gadigadi, kacel ki canduk mukene ki cal oyo adeng ma giteto ki jabu, ki cal akwota bur leba. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Dyangi gucito gukemo yoo atir ma dok tung Bet-cemec, kun lubu yoo ger madit. Guwoto kun gikok, pe gumedo ki dok tung acuc nyo tung acam, kun rwodi pa jo Piliciti gilubu korgi, nio ka guo kwede wa iwang lobo me Bet-cemec. <verse eid="1SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Onongo jo Bet-cemec gitye kakayo nganogi i nota. Ka gutingo wanggi ci guneno Canduk pa Rwot, ci cwinygi obedo yom pi nenone. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Gadigadi obino wa i poto pa Yocwa ma Labet-cemec, ci ocung kenyo. Onongo kidi madit tye kenyo; ci gubaro gadigadi woko me yen, gutyero dyangi macalo gitum awanga bot Rwot. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Ka dok Lulevi gutero Canduk pa Rwot ki canduk mukene ma onongo tye kangeteni, ma onongo tye iye cal jabu, ka guketogi iwi kidi maditi. Ci jo Bet-cemec gutyero gitum awanga ki gitum mukene mogo bot Rwot inino meno. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Ka rwodi pa jo Piliciti abici guneno jami ducu, ci gudok cen i Ekron inino meno.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Cal akwota bur leba me jabu ma jo Piliciti gudwoko bot Rwot me gityer me tingo alii obedo kit man; acel pa jo Acidod, acel pa jo Gaja, ki acel pa jo Acikelon, acel pa jo Gat, acel pa jo Ekron. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Gucwalo cal oyo adeng me jabu muporo wel taun ducu pa jo Piliciti ma rwodigi abic giloyo. Taun magi kicelogi ki cel matego, wa ki gangi matinotino ma pe kirumugi ki cel. Kidi madit mayam kiketo Canduk pa Rwot kangeteni, matye i poto pa Yocwa Labet-cemec pud tye wa onyo macalo caden.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Rwot oneko jo Bet-cemec mogo, pien gungiyo i Canduk pa Rwot. En oneko jo pyere abiro ki ikin gi, ci dano gukumu, pien Rwot oneko jo mapol ikin gi.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitero Canduk pa Rwot Kiriat-jearim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Ka dok jo Bet-cemec guwaco ni, “Anga matwero cung inyim Rwot ma Lubanga malengi? Dok ka bia ki botwa, ci bicito bot jo mene?” <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Pimeno gucwalo lukwena bot jo ma gibedo i Kiriat-jearim, kun giwaco ni, “Jo Piliciti dong gudwoko Canduk pa Rwot. Wubin, wuter botwu kunu.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 6:2-4">2 Cam 6:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:5-7">1 Tek 13:5-7</ref></char>
    </note>Ci jo Kiriat-jearim gucito guomo Canduk pa Rwot, gutero i ot pa Abinadab ma iwi got. Ci gukwero wode Eleajar pi gwokone.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Camuel ongolo kop i Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Canduk pa Rwot obedo i Kiriat-jearim pi kare malac ma nongo mito romo mwaka pyere aryo, ci jo me ot pa Icrael ducu gucako dwogo bot Rwot ki kumu. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Ci Camuel owaco bot jo Icrael ni, “Ka dong wudwogo bot Rwot ki cwinywu ducu, ci dong wubol lwak lubanga pa lurok ki cal jogi ma mon gu woko ki ikinwu, wek cwinywu okem bot Rwot atir kun wuworo en keken, ci en bilarowu ki i cing jo Piliciti.”<verse eid="1SA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Kitmeno jo Icrael gubolo lwak cal jok Baal ki cal jogi ma mon gu matye botgini woko, ci gucako woro Rwot keken.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Camuel dok owaco ni, “Wucok jo Icrael ducu i Mijpa ci abilego pirwu bot Rwot.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Ma omiyo dano gucoke i Mijpa ka dok gutwomo pii ci guonyo piny inyim Rwot macalo gityer, ci gurii kec inino meno kun giwaco ni, “Watimo bal inyim Rwot.” Dok Camuel ongolo kop pa jo Icrael pirgi i Mijpa. <verse eid="1SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Ikare meno ka jo Piliciti guwinyo ni jo Icrael gucoke i Mijpa, ci rwodi pa jo Piliciti gucito kalweny ikom jo Icrael. Ka jo Icrael guwinyo, ci gubedo ki lworo madit pi dul mony pa jo Piliciti. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Ci jo Icrael guwaco bot Camuel ni, “Pe iwek koko pirwa bot Rwot Lubangawa wek olarwa ki i cing jo Piliciti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Ci Camuel okwanyo latin romo ma pud dot, otyero bot Rwot obed gitum ma kiwango olu. Ka Camuel okok bot Rwot pi jo Icrael, ci Rwot owinyo kokone. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Ikare ma Camuel tye katyero gitum awanga, jo Piliciti gucako bino cok kalweny ikom jo Icrael; ento Rwot omor macalo mor kot ki dwon madit inino meno ikom jo Piliciti, obango komgi woko; ci jo Icrael guryemogi woko ki inyimgi. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Jo Icrael gumol woko ki i Mijpa, guryemo kor jo Piliciti, ci gurwadogi woko nio wa ite Bet-kar.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Lacen Camuel okwanyo got, ocibo ocung ikin Mijpa ki Jecana, ci ocako nyinge Ebenejer<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="fk">Ebenejer </char> teloke ni got me kony.</note> kun waco ni, “Rwotobedo ka konyowa o wa kany.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Ci jo Icrael guloyo jo Piliciti kitmeno; ci pe dok gudonyo i lobo pa jo Icrael. Rwot obedo kalweny ikom jo Piliciti ikare pa Camuel ducu. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Taun madito ducu mayam jo Piliciti gumayo woko ki bot jo Icrael kidwokogi bot jo Icrael, cake wa i Ekron nio kwede wa i Gat. Jo Icrael gularo lobogi ki i cing jo Piliciti i karenu. Kuc onongo tye ikin jo Icrael ki jo Amor bene.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Camuel otelo jo Icrael ikare me kwone ducu. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Yam woto kun wire ikin Betel ki Gilgal ki Mijpa mwaka ki mwaka kun ngolo kop pa jo Icrael i kabedo meno ducu. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Ka dong en loke dok Rama, pien gange onongo tye kunu. En ngolo kop pa jo Icrael kunu bene, dok ocano keno tyer pi Rwot kunu.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gulego pi rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Ikare ma Camuel dong otii woko, en oketo awobene gubedo lungolkop pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Nying wode me kayone Joel, ki nying wode me aryone Abija; yam gubedo lungolkop ki i Beer-ceba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Ento awobe pa Camuel pe gulubu kit pa won gi, gubwoto woko, gudok kayenyo lim. Gubedo kagamo lim me wilo loyo kop ki ikot, kun gibalo te pido pa dano woko.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Ci ludongo pa jo Icrael ducu gucoke kacel bot Camuel i Rama, <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:14">Nwo 17:14</ref></char></note>guwaco bote ni, “Nen ba, in dong i tii woko, dok awobeni pe gilubu kiti. In iket rwot pirwa wek en aye olowa, macalo tye i rok mukene ducu.” <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Ento lok meno pe oyomo i Camuel ma guwaco ni, “Mii ki wan rwot wek en aye olowa.” Ka Camuel olego Rwot, <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />ci Rwot owaco bot Camuel ni, “Winy dog lwak i gin ducu ma guwaco boti. Pien gin pe gukwero in, ento gukwero an, ni an pe abed rwot ma loyogi. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Kit tim ducu ma gubedo katimone ikoma cake inino mayam akwanyogi iye ki i Ejipt o kwede wa tin, ma gubwoto an ci gudok ka woro lubanga mukene, gitye katimone ikomi bene kitmeno. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Koni dong kong iwiny doggi; lok acel keken, ber ilok kwedgi kun inyutu botgi atyer kit ma rwot ma biloyogi biterogi kwede.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Kitmeno Camuel otito lok pa Rwot ducu bot lwak ma gulego rwot ki bote. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Ci Camuel owaco ni, “Man aye bibedo kit ma rwot biloyowu kwede; en bitero awobewu ci ketogi i gadigadine me lweny, ki me bedo wegi aguragurane, ki jo ma ringo inyim gadigadine. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Dok en biketo ludito wi monye maloyo dano alip, ki maloyo dano pyere abic, ki jo mukene pi puru potone ki pi kayo kace, ki pi teto jami lwenye ki jami kom gadigadine. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />En bitero anyirawu karubu moo ma ngwece kur, ki pi tedo cam ki pi tedo mugati. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />En bimayo potiwu mabecone woko, ki poto olokwu ki poto jeituni, ci bitingo miyo bot lutice. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Bikwanyo dul acel me apar me kalwu ki me olokwu, ci tingo miyo bot ludito tice ki bot lutice mukene. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Bitero opiiwu ki angecawu, ki dyangiwu ki kanawu mabecone, ci biketogi katiyo tice. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />En bitero dul acel me apar me romiwu ki dyegiwu, ci dong wubibedo opiine. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Ikare meno wubikok giwu ikom rwotwu, ma wun aye wuyero pirwu kenwu; ento Rwot pe bidok iye botwu inino meno.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Ento dano gukwero winyo dog Camuel, ci guwaco bote ni, “Pe; wan wabibedo ki rwot ma loyowa, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />wek wan bene wabed macalo rok mukene ducu, wek rwotwa aye olowa, ci en okat anyim pi telo wiwa ki kalweny pirwa i mony.” <verse eid="1SA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Ka Camuel otyeko winyo lok pa lwak ducu, ci odwoko loke bot Rwot. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Ka Rwot dok owaco bot Camuel ni, “Winy doggi, i mii ki gin rwot,” Camuel dok owaco bot jo Icrael ni; “Dong wuciti, ngat acel acel odok cen i gange.”<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Caulo orwate ki Camuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Yam tye dano mo ma Labenjamin ma nyinge Kic, wod pa Abiel, ma wod pa Jeror, wod pa Bekorat, wod pa Apia, ma Labenjamin, dano ma lalonyo. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Onongo tye ki wode ma nyinge Caulo, awobi ma opute ma mwonya, ma pe tye dano mo ma ikin jo Icrael ducu ma mwonya makato en. Caulo odongo mabor makato dano ducu cake ki iwi gwoke dok kwede malo.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Ikare mo megi kana pa Kic won Caulo gurwenyo, ci Kic owaco bot wode Caulo ni, “Kwany latic mo acel, ci wua wucit kayenyo kana.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Ka gukato guwok i lobo godi me Epraim, ci gubaro dye lobo Calica, pe gunongo komgi. Ka dok gukato guwok i lobo Caalim, ento pe gunongo kana kunu. Ka dok gukato gubaro dye lobo me Benjamin, ento pe gunongo kana kunu.<verse eid="1SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Ka guo i lobo Jup, Caulo owaco bot latic ma onongo gitye kwedeni ni, “Bin wadok cen, wek wora pe ocak paro pirwa, kun weko paro pi kana.” <verse eid="1SA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Ento en odok iye ni, “Nen, dano pa Lubanga tye i gang man, en dano ma kiworo; gin ducu ma en waco bedo me ada. Wek kong wacit kunu; gwok en bitito botwa lok mo ikom kana kama waromo nongogi iye.” <verse eid="1SA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Ento Caulo owaco bot latice ni, “Ka wacito bote, wabitere gin ango? Pien mugati dong otum woko ki i kicaawa, dok mot mo pe ma wabitero bot dano pa Lubanga ca.” <verse eid="1SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Latice dok ogamo doge ni, “Nen kany, atye ki cekel me ryal mo manok; abimiyo bot dano pa Lubanga wek onyut botwa kama waromo nongogi iye.”<verse eid="1SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />(Ikare pa jo Icrael macon, ka dano mo yam cito kapenyo dog Lubanga ci waco ni, “Bin, wek wacit bot lanenpiny;” pien dano ma kilwongo ni lanebi ikare man, yam con kilwongo ni lanenpiny.) <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Ci Caulo owaco bot latice ni, “Iwaco maber, bin wek waciti.” Kitmeno gucako cito i gang kama dano pa Lubanga bedo iyeni.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Ikare ma giito kor got pi donyo i taun ci gurwate ki anyira ma gicito katwomo pii, ci gupenyogi ni, “Lanenpiny tye kany?” <verse eid="1SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Gugamo ni, “En tye. Nen, tye inyimwa ca. Wurune oyot; pud obino i taun man kombedi, pien tin dano tye katyero gityer i kabedo me woro Lubanga matye iwi got. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Ka wucito, wudonyo i taun, ci wubinongo kome cut, ma nongo peya ocito ka cam iwi got. Pien dano peya gibicam ka en peya obino, nio ka en olego gum ikom gitum; ka dong jo ma kilwongogi gicako cam. Wun dong wuciti, ci wubirwate kwede oyotoyot.” <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Kitmeno gumede ki ito malo wa i taun. Ka gitye ka donyo i taun, ci guneno Camuel tye kabino tung botgi kun onongo obicito ikabedo ma kiworo Rwot iye iwi got.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Onongo Rwot onyutu lok bot Camuel ma pud onongo Caulo odong ki nino acel me bino bote kun waco ni, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Diki ikine me cawa ma kit man abicwalo boti dano mo ma oa ki i lobo pa jo Benjamin, ci ibiwiro en ki moo wek obed laker maloyo jona jo Icrael. En bilaro jona ki i cing jo Piliciti; pien atyeko neno aroma pa jona, ki kokogi dong oo bota.” <verse eid="1SA 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Ka Camuel oneno Caulo, ci Rwot Lubanga otito bote ni, “Man aye dano ma onongo atiti pireni. En aye biloyo lwaka.” <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Ka Caulo dong oo cok bot Camuel i dog cel me taun, ci openye ni, “Tita ba, ot pa lanenpiny tye kwene?” <verse eid="1SA 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Ci Camuel ogamo ni, “An aye lanenpiny. Cit itel nyima nio i kabedo me woro Lubanga ma iwi got, pien ibicam kweda kacel tin, ka diki odiko abiweki icito, dok abimiyi lagam ducu ikom lapeny ma itye kwede i cwinyi. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Lok ikom kana ma gurwenyo okato nino adeki, pe cwinyi obed kaparo pirgi, pien dong kityeko nongogi. Ento anga ma jo Icrael ducu dong gutyeko keto gen gi ikome? Pe ikom in ki i ot pa woru aye?” <verse eid="1SA 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Ci Caulo ogamo ni, “An gira Labenjamin, ma kakawa tidi tutwal ikin jo Icrael. Dogolawa onyongo anyonga ki ikin dogola ducu pa jo Benjamin. Ci pingo iloka lok marom meno?”<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Camuel otero Caulo ki latice, okelogi i kicika, ka omiyogi kabedo me dito makato jo ma kilwongogi ducu, ma giromo jo pyere adek. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Ci Camuel owaco bot latedo ni, “Kel wang pok ma nakanen amiyo botini, kun aciki ni iket pat.” <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Ci latedo okwanyo em ki bam, ocibo inyim Caulo, ci Camuel owaco bot Caulo ni, “Nen, gin ma kikano piri gityeko cibone inyimi. Cam, pien onongo kikano piri nio wa ikare ma kiciko, wek icam kacel ki welo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 9:24">Kitmeno Caulo ocamo kacel ki Camuel i ninonu. <verse eid="1SA 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Ka dong gulor gudwogo piny ki i kabedo ma iwi got, ci gucito i taun. Kipeto kabutu pa Caulo malo iwi ot, ci obutu piny, onino woko. <verse eid="1SA 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Ka piny dong oyabe, Camuel olwongo Caulo ma onongo pud tye malo iwi ot kun waco ni, “A malo, wek dong alwoki, iciti.” Caulo oa malo, ci en ki Camuel gucito i yoo gin aryo.<verse eid="1SA 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Camuel owiro Caulo me bedo rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Ka onongo gitye kalor piny, ma dong guo i agiki taun, Camuel owaco bot Caulo ni, “Wac ki latici okat ocit inyimwa. Ka latice dong okato anyim, ci Camuel owaco ki Caulo ni, in kong icung kany manok, wek amiyi i nge lok pa Lubanga.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Ci Camuel okwanyo adomo me moo, oonyo iwi Caulo, ka onoto leme ci owaco ni, “Rwot dong oonyo moo ikomi wek ibed laker maloyo lwake jo Icrael. In ibiloyo lwak pa Rwot, ci ibilarogi ki i cing lumerokgi ma gurumugini. Man aye bibedo gin ma nyutu boti ni Rwot dong owiri me bedo laker maloyo gipinye: <figure style="fig" alt="Samuel anointing Saul as ruler" file="co00984b.TIF" size="col" loc="1Sa10:1" copy="David Cook" ref="10:1">Camuel wiro Caulo me bedo laker</figure> <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Ka ibia woko ki bota tin, ci ibirwate ki co aryo inget lyel pa Lakeri ma i Jelja, i lobo Benjamin. Ci gibiwaco boti ni, ‘Kana ma ibedo kayenyogini dong kinongogi, dok kombedi cwiny woru dong oa woko ki ikom kana, dong tye kaparo pirwu aye kun bako doge ni, atim gin ango pi wodani?’ <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Dong ibimede ki wot anyim, ci ibio ite kworo me Tabor; ci co adek ma gicito i Betel bot Lubanga gibirwate kwedi kunu, kun ngat acel otingo lutino dyegi adek, ngat acel otingo mugati adek, ngat acel otingo opiru kongo bwino. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Gin bimoti, ci gibimini mugati aryo, ci in ibigamo, ki i cinggi. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Ka lacen ibio i Gibea-eloim, kama cel gogo mony pa jo Piliciti tye iyeni. Ka ibidonyo i taun kunu, ibirwate ki lwak lunebi ma gibino gilor piny kun gia ki ikabedo me woro Lubanga ma iwi got, ma gitye ki dano ma gigoyo nanga ki ajaa ki nyamulere ki opuk ma gitelo kwede nyimgi, kun lunebi giwoto ki tito lok pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Ci Cwiny pa Rwot bibino ikomi ki tek, ci ibicako tito lok pa Lubanga kacel kwedgi, ci ibiloke idoko dano ma pat. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Ka lanyut meno ducu dong otime ikomi ci dong i tim gin ma Lubanga bitelo in iye ducu, pien nongo en tye kwedi. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />In icit ikwong nyima i Gilgal; nen, abibino boti katyero gitum awanga ki gityer me berbedo. Ibikuru an nino abiro nio ka abio boti kanyutu boti gin ma myero i tii.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Ka Caulo oloko ngeye pi weko Camuel, Lubanga omine kit cwiny ma pat; ci lanyut meno gutime ducu inino meno. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Ka guo i Gibea, ci nen, lwak lunebi gurwate kwede; ci Cwiny pa Lubanga obino ikome ki tek, ci ocako tito lok pa Lubanga ikin gi. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Ka jo mayam gingeye guneno kit ma en tito kwede lok pa Lubanga kacel ki lunebi, ci dano gucako lok keken gi ni, “Gin ango ma opoto ikom wod pa Kic? Caulo bene dong tye ikin lunebi?” <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:23-24">1 Cam 19:23-24</ref></char></note>Ci dano mo ma bedo kunu ogamo ni, “Lunebi ni kono con, onongo wegigi kono anga?” Ma omiyo odoko carolok abola ni, “Caulo bene dong tye ikin lunebi?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Ka dong otyeko tito lok pa Lubanga ci ocito ikabedo me woro Lubanga ma iwi got.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Omin won Caulo onene, ci openyo en ki latice ni, “Onongo wucito wa kwene?” Ci ogamo ni, “Wacito kayenyo kana; ka waneno ni pe gibinonge, ci wacito wa bot Camuel.” <verse eid="1SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Ci omin won Caulo dok owaco ni, “Kong itit bota gin ma Camuel owaco boti mono.” <verse eid="1SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Ci Caulo owaco bot omin wone ni, “Otito botwa atir ni kana dong kinongo.” Ento Caulo pe otito lok me camo ker ma onongo Camuel oloko boteni.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwir okwanyo Caulo me bedo rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Ikare meno Camuel olwongo lwak ocoke kacel bot Rwot i Mijpa. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Ka owaco bot jo Icrael ni, “Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kit man ni, ‘Yam akwanyo jo Icrael ki i Ejipt, alarowu ki i cing jo Ejipt ki i cing Luker ducu ma gubedo kaunuwu.’ <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Ento tin wutyeko kwero Lubangawu woko ma bedo kalarowu ki i can ki i ayelawu ducu, ci dong wuwaco ni, ‘Pe kumeno; ento imiwa rwot ma biloyowa.’ Dong wubin wucung inyim Rwot kun wurye kaka ki kaka ki dogola ki dogola.”<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Camuel okelo kaka ma i Icrael ducu cok, ci kwir okwanyo kaka pa Benjamin. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Okelo kaka pa Benjamin cok dogola ki dogola, ci kwir okwanyo dogola pa jo Matri. Ka lacen dong okelo dogola pa jo Matri cok ki acel acel, ci kwir okwanyo Caulo wod pa Kic. Ento ka gubedo kayenye, ci pe kinongo kome. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Ma omiyo gucito, gupenyo dog Rwot dok ni, “Danonu tika obino kany?” Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Nen, en tye okane ikin jami.” <verse eid="1SA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Ci guringo gucito, guomo en ki kunu. Ka ocung i dye lwak, nen, odongo mabor makato dano ducu, cake ki iwi gwoke dok kwede malo. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Ci Camuel owaco bot lwak ducu ni, “Dong wuneno ngat ma Rwot oyeroni? Pe tye ngat mo ikin wun lwak ducu ma cal kwede.” Ci lwak ducu gudange ki woo ni, “Rwot ma kiyeroni obed kwo nakanaka!”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Camuel dok otito bot lwak twero ki tic pa rwot, ka dong ocoyogi i buk, ci opyelo ikabedo maleng. Lacen Camuel ocwalo lwak ipacigi, ci ngat acel acel odok i pacone. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Caulo bene odok i pacone i Gibea. Ci jo mogo ma twoni oteka bene gucito ki Caulo, gin aye jo ma Lubanga ogudu cwinygi. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Ento jo mogo ma kitgi obedo atata guwaco ni, “Danoni bilarowa ningning?” Gubedo kacayo en, ci pe gumedo ki tero mot mo bote. Ento Caulo oling mere mot.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Caulo oloyo mony pa jo Ammon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Ka dwe acel dong okato, Nakac ma jo Ammon ocito orumu taun me Jabec-gilead ki monye; ci jo ducu ma i Jabec guwaco bot Nakac ni, “Ber icike kwedwa, ci wabidoko lutici.” <verse eid="1SA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Ento Nakac ogamo doggi ni, “Abicike kwedwu kit man, abikolo wangwu tung acuc woko ducu, wek aket lewic ikom jo Icrael ducu.” <verse eid="1SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Ci ludongo ma i Jabec gugamo doge kun gin waco ni, “Kong imiwa nino abiro wek wacwal lukwena i lobo Icrael ducu. Ka ngat mo pe onen ma larowa, ci wabimine kenwa boti.” <verse eid="1SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Ka lukwena gubino i Gibea i gang pa Caulo, gutito loke bot lwak; ci lwak ducu guwoo ki koko matek.<verse eid="1SA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Ikare meno onongo Caulo oa ka pur i poto, ci en obedo kalubu nge twoni pur ikare ma odwogo ki i poto, ci owaco ni, “Ango mutime? Pingo dano tye kakoko?” Ci kitite lok kom jo Jabec. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Ka Caulo owinyo loke, ci Cwiny pa Lubanga obino ki tek ikome, kun kiniga omake madwong. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Ci okwanyo twoni pur aryo, otongogi, ongido matinotino, ci ocwalo komgi ki i cing lukwena ma guwoto orumu kwede i lobo Icrael ducu kun giwaco ni, “Dano mo ma pe obino olubu kor Caulo ki Camuel, kibitimo twoni pure kit man!” Lworo omako dano matek pi Rwot, ma omiyo dano gumol gubino ki cwiny acel. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Ka Caulo oryeyo lwak i Bejek, okwanogi, ci jo Icrael guromo alip miya adek, ki jo Juda guromo alip pyere adek. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Ci guwaco bot lukwena ma gubino botgi ni, “Wuwac bot jo Jabec-gilead ni, ‘Diki ka ceng odoko lyet kibilarowu.’ ” Ka lukwena gucito gutito bot jo Jabec, cwinygi obedo yom matek. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />En aye omiyo jo Jabec guwaco bot jo Ammon ni, “Wabimine kenwa diki i cingwu, ci wubitimowa kit ma wumito ducu.” <verse eid="1SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Orwone Caulo opoko mony i buca adek; ci gucoro i dye gony pa jo Ammon kwarpiny, ci gucako nekogi nio wa i dyeceng. Jo ma gubwote guket woko ata, ma pe inongo co aryo mo gudong kacel.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Ka man otum, lwak dok owaco bot Camuel ni, “Angagi mayam guwaco ni, ‘Caulo aye biloyowa bo?’ Kikel jonu wek wanekgi woko.” <verse eid="1SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Ento Caulo ogamo ni, “Pe tin kineko iye dano mo, pien tin aye Rwot olaro jo Icrael.” <verse eid="1SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Ka Camuel dok owaco bot lwak ni, “Wubin, wacit i Gilgal, wek wacit wakweru ker odoco kunu.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Ma omiyo lwak ducu gucito i Gilgal, ci guketo Caulo me bedo rwot ki i kabedo Maleng. Gutyero gityer me berbedo kunu inyim Rwot, ci Caulo ki jo Icrael ducu cwinygi obedo yom mada.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Camuel oloko ki lwak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Camuel owaco bot jo Icrael ducu ni, “Nen, dong atyeko winyo dogwu i lok ducu ma wuwaco bota; dong amiyowu rwot me loyowu. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Koni dong wunen, rwot tye katelo wiwu. An dong atii woko ma wiya ki lwar; dok, wunen, awobena bene gitye kwedwu. Abedo latel wiwu cake wa katinona nio kwede wa onyo. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />An atye ene, wutit lok ma mako koma inyim Rwot ki inyim laker ma mere ma kiwiro ki moo. Anga ma akwanyo twone? Anga ma akwanyo kanane? Nyo anga ma abumo jamine? Anga mayam aburu? Nyo anga mayam agamo lim me wilo loyo kop ki i cinge me laum wang? Wutit lok ma mako koma, ci abidwoko wange botwu.” <verse eid="1SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Ci gin gugamo ni, “In yam pe ibumu jamiwa mo, kadi buruwa, nyo gamo jami mo ki i cing dano mo.” <verse eid="1SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Ci en owaco botgi ni, “Rwot aye lacaden ikomwu, ki laker ma mere ma kiwiro ki moo bene aye lacaden tin ma moko ni, pe wunongo bal mo ikoma.” Ci gugamo ni, “En aye caden.”<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 6:26">Nia 6:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Camuel dok owaco bot lwak ni, “Rwot aye caden mayam oyero Moses ki Aron ci okwanyo kwariwa woko ki i Ejipt. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Ma omiyo kombedi dong wucung mot, wek apid kop ikomwu inyim Rwot ikit ducu ma Rwot olarowu kwede, mayam otimo pirwu ki pi kwariwu. <verse eid="1SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:23">Nia 2:23</ref></char></note>Ka yam Yakobo ki jone gucito i Ejipt, ci jo Ejipt obwoyogi ki tek, ma omiyo kwariwu gukok bot Rwot. Ka dong Rwot ocwalo Moses ki Aron ma gukwanyo kwariwu ki i Ejipt ci gumiyogi gubedo i kabedo man. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:12">Lung 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:2">4:2</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:1">13:1</ref></char></note>Ento wigi ocako wil ikom Rwot Lubangagi woko; ci omiyogi i cing Cicera ma lawimony pa Jabin, rwot me Kajor, ki i cing jo Piliciti, ki i cing rwot me Moab, ci gucako lweny ikomgi. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 10:10-15">Lung 10:10-15</ref></char></note>Ci gukok bot Rwot kun giwaco ni, ‘Wan dong wabalo, pien wabwoto Rwot woko, waworo jogi Baal ki jogi ma mon gu. Ento dong ilarwa ki i cing lukworwa, ci wabiworo in keken.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:20">1 Cam 3:20</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6">Lung 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 7:1">7:1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:29">11:29</ref></char></note>Ka dok Rwot ocwalo Jerubaal ki Barak, ki Jeputa ki an, ci olarowu ki i cing lumerokwu tungi ki tungi, ci wubedo mot ki kuc. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:19">1 Cam 8:19</ref></char></note>Lacen ka wuneno ni Nakac rwot pa jo Ammon obino kalweny ikomwu, ci wuwaco bota ni, ‘Pe kumeno; ento rwot aye biloyowa,’ ma kun onongo Rwot Lubangawu aye rwotwu. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Kombedi dong wunen rwotwu ma wuyeroni, mayam wupenya pireni. Nen, Rwot dong oketo rwot ma loyowu. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Kace wubilworo Rwot ci wutiyo bote kun wuwinyo doge, ma kun pe wujemo nyo wukwero cik pa Rwot woko, dok ka wun ki rwotwu ma loyowuni ce wubilubu kor Rwot Lubangawu, ci bibedo ber. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Ento kace pe wubiwinyo dog Rwot, nyo wujemo ma wukwero cik pa Rwot woko, ci Rwot bimiyo pwod ikomwu ki ikom rwotwu. <verse eid="1SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />Kombedi wun dong wucung mot wek wunen kit gin madit ma Rwot bitiyo inyimwu. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Kareni kare me kayo ngano; pe kumeno? Dong an abilego Rwot wek ocwal kot ma mor kun cwer kwede, ci wubingeyo dok wubineno kit ma balwu dit kwede ma wutimo inyim Rwot pi penyo pi rwot pirwu kenwu.” <verse eid="1SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Kitmeno Camuel olego Rwot, ci Rwot ocwalo kot ma mor kun cwer kwede inino meno; ma omiyo lwak ducu gubedo ki lworo madwong mada ikom Rwot ki ikom Camuel.<verse eid="1SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Ci lwak ducu guwaco bot Camuel ni, “Ladit, leg pirwa bot Rwot Lubangani wek pe wato, pien wapongo wi balwa ki tim marac man me penyo pi rwot pirwa kenwa.” <verse eid="1SA 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Ci Camuel owaco bot lwak ni, “Pe wulwor, wutyeko timo gin maracu magi ducu, ento pe dok wuloke wubare woko ki kalubu kor Rwot, ento dong wutii bot Rwot ki cwinywu ducu. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Pe wuloke wubare woko wudok kalubu kor gin atata ma pe konyo, ma pe laro dano mo, pien gin atata. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Pien Rwot pe bibolo lwake woko ata, pi nyinge maditi, pien yomcwiny oa ki i Rwot ma oketowu me bedo jone kikome. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Dok bene ki tung bota pe myero atim bal bot Rwot me weko lega pirwu; dok abipwonyowu kit me lubu yo atir ki maber. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Wulwor Rwot keken, dok wutii bote ki gen madwong ki cwinywu ducu; pieno wubed katamo kit gin madito mayam Rwot obedo katiyone pirwu. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Ento ka pud wumede katimo tim maracu, ci kibijwerowu woko, wun kacel ki rwotwu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Lweny ki jo Piliciti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Caulo onongo dong pe dano matidi ikare ma ocamo ker, mwaka me dite nongo romo pyere adek; ci en oloyo jo Icrael pi mwaka pyere angwen wiye aryo.<verse eid="1SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Caulo oyero jo Icrael alip adek; ci jo alip aryo gubedo bote i Mikmac ki i lobo godi me Betel, ki alip acel gubedo bot Yonacan i Gibea i lobo Benjamin. Jo mudonge en ocwalogi woko paco, ma ngat acel acel odok i kemane.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonacan oloyo mony pa jo Piliciti ki i cel gogo matye i Geba, ci jo Piliciti guwinyo pire. Caulo okutu tum okwange oromo lobo ducu kun waco ni, “Wek jo Ibru ducu guwiny.” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Ci jo Icrael ducu guwinyo ni, Caulo oloyo mony pa jo Piliciti ki i cel gogo, dok bene ni, nying jo Icrael odoko ngwe lituny bot jo Piliciti. Ci kilwongo lwak gucoke bot Caulo i Gilgal.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Jo Piliciti gurwayo mony kalweny ki jo Icrael ki gadigadi lweny alip pyere adek, ki wegi aguragura alip abicel, ki lwak mony madwong macalo kweyo me dog nam. Ci gubino guguru gonygi i Mikmac matye inget Bet-aven tung kunyango. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Ka jo Icrael guneno ni dong kidingogi matek ma dong gitye marac tutwal, ci dano gukane i boro ki i bur, ki ikin godi ki i lyel ki i bur piigu. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Jo mogo gungolo kulu Jordan, gucito wa i lobo Gad ki Gilead. Onongo Caulo pud tye i Gilgal, ci lwak ducu gilubu kore ki myelkom.<verse eid="1SA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 10:8">1 Cam 10:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gukure pi nino abiro ma onongo Camuel ocikoni; ento Camuel pe obino i Gilgal, ci lwak ocako ket woko ki bot Caulo. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Ma omiyo Caulo owaco ni, “Wukela gitum awanga kany, ki gityer me berbedo.” Ci otyero gitum awanga.<verse eid="1SA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Ka onongo pud otyeko tyero gitum awanga atyeka, ci nen, Camuel otugi bino cut. Ka Caulo okato woko karwate kwede ki mote. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Ci Camuel openyo en ni, “Ibedo katimo gin ango?” Ci Caulo ogamo ni, “Ka aneno ni dano gucako ket woko ki bota, dok bene pe ibino inino ma onongo icikoni, kun jo Piliciti dong gurwayo woko cok ki Mikmac, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />ci atamo ni, ‘Jo Piliciti dong gibipoto ikoma ki i Gilgal kany, ma peya atango cinga akwayo Rwot’; ci dong atamo pira kena katyero gitum awanga.” <verse eid="1SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Ci Camuel owaco bot Caulo ni, “Itimo gin me mingo keken. In pe igwoko cik pa Rwot Lubangani mayam ociki kwede; kono onongo igwoko, kono Lubanga omoko keri me loyo Icrael matwal. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:22">Tic 13:22</ref></char></note>Ento kombedi keri dong pe bicung; Rwot dong otyeko yero dano ma bitimo gin ma cwinye mito. Dok Rwot oketo en me bedo laker maloyo lwake, pien in pe igwoko gin ma Rwot yam ociki kwede.” <verse eid="1SA 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Ci Camuel oa malo, ki i Gilgal ocito i Gibea i lobo pa jo Benjamin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:15">Caulo okwano wel dano ma gitye bote, ci guromo miya abicel. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Caulo ki wode Yonacan ki jo ma gitye bote gubedo i Geba i lobo pa jo Benjamin, ento jo Piliciti gugony i Mikmac. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Luyak gua ki i gony pa jo Piliciti buca mony adek; buca acel odok tung Opra ma i lobo Cual, <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />buca mukene odok tung Bet-koron, ki buca mukene odok tung wang lobo ma neno piny i nota Jeboim ma tung tim ata.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Ikare meno onongo latet mo pe i nongo i lobo Icrael ducu, pien yam jo Piliciti guwaco ni, “Pe wawek jo Ibru gutet pala lucwangi nyo tonggi pirgi ken gi.” <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Ento dano acel acel ki ikin jo Icrael obedo kacito bot jo Piliciti kapako lak kweri dyange, nyo kweri kidima, nyo latong nyo pala kace. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Ci gingolo wel cule bedo cekel aryo ma nyige pi lak kweri dyang ki pi kidima, ka dok cekel acel pi pako lak latong ki pi como dim. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Kitmeno omiyo ikare me lweny pala lucwan nyo tong pe kinongo i cing dano mo ki ikin jo ma gitye bot Caulo ki Yonacan. Ento Caulo ki wode Yonacan onongo gire gitye ki meggi. <verse eid="1SA 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Ci jo ma gitye i cel gogo mony pa jo Piliciti gumol gukato woko, gucito iwang apiding me Mikmac me gwokone.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yonacan i cel gogo pa jo Piliciti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Inino mo acel Yonacan wod pa Caulo owaco bot awobi ma tingo jami lwenye ni, “Bin wek wakat bot mony ma i cel gogo pa jo Piliciti matye loka cani.” Ento pe otito bot wone. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Onongo Caulo ogony i agiki gang me Gibea ite yat pomegranat mayam tye i Migron. Onongo jo ma gitye kwede gin romo miya abicel, <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />kacel ki Akija wod pa Akitub, omin Ikabod wod pa Finekaci ma wod pa Eli. Akija aye obedo ajwaka pa Rwot i Cilo ma ruku epod. Lwak pe gungeyo ni Yonacan ocito. <verse eid="1SA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Iwang apiding ma Yonacan obedo kayenyo yoo me kato kwede ikom mony ma i cel gogo pa jo Pilicitini, onongo tye iye got ma ocule tungcel ki got ma ocule tung mukene bene. Nying got acel Bojej ki nying mukene Cene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Got acel ocung ocule tung malo me apiding ma okemo Mikmac, ki mukene tung kupiny ma okemo Geba.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonacan owaco bot awobi ma tingo jami lwenye ni, “Bin wek wakat bot mony ma i cel gogo pa joni ma pe gingeyo Lubanga; gwok Rwot bitiyo gin mo pirwa kunu, pien pe tye gin mo ma gengo Rwot laro dano kadi gipol onyo ginok.” <verse eid="1SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Lating jami lwenye owaco bote ni, “Tim gin ducu ma cwinyi oteri iye. Nen, an atye kacel kwedi; kit macalo cwinyi otamo kwede, mera bene kitmeno.” <verse eid="1SA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonacan dok owaco ni, “Wabiwok wakato bot jo ca, ci wabinyute kenwa botgi. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Kace guwaco ni, ‘Wukur nio ka wao botwu,’ ci wabicung giwa mot i kabedowa, pe wabiito malo botgi. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Ento ka guwaco ni, ‘Wubin malo botwa kany,’ ci wabiito malo kunu, pien nongo Rwot dong otyeko miyogi i cingwa. Meno aye bibedo lanyut botwa.” <verse eid="1SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Kitmeno gin aryo ducu gunyute keken gi bot mony pa jo Piliciti matye i cel gogo; ci jo Piliciti guwaco ni, “Nen, jo Ibru gibino ca, gitye kakato woko ki i bur ma gukane iye.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Ci co me mony ma i cel gogo gulwongo Yonacan ki lating jami lwenye kun gin waco ni, “Wubin malo botwa, ci wabinyutu gin mo botwu.” Yonacan owaco bot lating jami lwenye ni, “Bin ilub kora, pien Rwot otyeko miyogi i cing jo Icrael.”<verse eid="1SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Ka dong Yonacan ocako ito malo kun cito kobo ki cinge ki tyene, ki lating jami lwenye lubu kore. Yonacan otongo Lupiliciti ci gupoto woko piny inyime, kun lating jami lwenye obedo ka nekogi ki i kore. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />I nek meno mukwongoni ma Yonacan ki lating jami lwenye gutimoni, guneko dano pyere aryo ikabedo maromo nucu eka. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Dano gutware ki lworo madwong i gony pa jo Piliciti, mony ma gitye woko i bar, ki mony matye i gogo, kadi wa luyak bene komgi omyel. Lobo oyenge, ci twon lworo madwong ki atiba omako dano.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Ka lukurpiny pa Caulo ma i Gibea matye i lobo Benjamin guneno lwak jo Piliciti guket gigwenye atata, gidok tungi ki tungi, <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />ci Caulo owaco bot lwak ma gitye bote ni, “Kong wukwan dano wek wanen anga ma okato woko ki botwa.” Gukwano dano, ci nen, Yonacan ki lating jami lwenye onongo gipeke kunu. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Ci Caulo owaco bot Akija ni, “Kel Canduk me Gicike kany.” Pien onongo Canduk me Gicike woto kacel ki jo Icrael ikare meno. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Ikare ma Caulo tye kalok ki ajwaka pa Lubangani, woo obedo ka mede ameda i gony pa jo Piliciti, ma omiyo Caulo owaco bot ajwaka ni, “Wek dong obedi.” <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Caulo ki jo ducu ma gitye kwede gucako wayu, ci gucito gudonyo kalweny. Ci nen, dano acel acel ki ikin jo Piliciti cobo lawote ki pala lucwane; pien komgi obange woko tutwal. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Jo Ibru mayam con gubedo bot jo Piliciti, mayam gumol gucito kwedgi i gonygini, guloke gudwogo cen bot jo Icrael ma gitye kacel ki Caulo ki Yonacan. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Kitmeno wa jo Icrael mayam onongo gukane ikin godi me lobo Epraim, ka guwinyo ni jo Piliciti gitye karingo woko, gin bene guryemo korgi matek kalweny ikomgi. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Rwot olaro jo Icrael inino meno; ci lweny omede wa inge Bet-aven.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gin ma otime inge lweny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Kec onuru kom jo Icrael inino meno; pien Caulo onongo okwongo kwong ki inyim dano kun waco ni, “Cen opot ikom dano mo ma ocamo cam ma peya piny oyutu, ma nongo pud atye ka culu kwor ikom lukwora.” Kitmeno pe wunen ni ngat mo obilo cam. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Ka dano ducu gucore i bunga, gunongo moo kic orade ata wa i ngom. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Kadi bed dano, guneno moo kic ma oton piny orade ata, ento dano mo pe oketo idoge, pien lwak gubedo ka lworo kwong pa Caulo. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Ento Yonacan onongo pe owinyo ka wone kwongo kwong kun ciko ki dano. Kitmeno en olutu wi odoo ma onongo tye i cinge, i peda kic, ci ogwelo ki cinge onango; ci ocako winyo agonya. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Dano mo acel ma ikin lwak owaco ni, “Woru ociko dano kun kwongo kwong matek ni, ‘Cen obed ikom dano ma ocamo cam inino man.’” Ci kadi bed kec onongo obwoyo dano woko ngat mo pe ocamo gin mo. <verse eid="1SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonacan ogamo ni, “Wora okelo can i lobo. Nen kit ma wanga ogony kwede pien atyeko bilo moo kic man manok. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Bedo ber tutwal kono onongo dano gucamo gin ma guyako ki bot lumerokgi? Pien, kono guneko jo Piliciti mapol mada.”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Ci kineko jo Piliciti inino meno cake ki i Mikmac o wa i Aijalon. Ento kec onongo obwoyo dano mada; <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />ci dano gucako mwome ikom lee ma kiyako, ci gumako romi ki twoni ki rocigu guradogi woko piny, ci lwak gucako mwodo ringone kacel ki remo. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Aca 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lev 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Nwo 12:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23">23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref></char></note>Ka kitito bot Caulo ni, “Nen, dano gubalo inyim Rwot pi mwodo ringo ki remo,” ci en ogamo ni, “Wutimo me dwalo doga! Wulor kidi madit tung bota kany.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Caulo dok owaco ni, “Wuket lok orom kin dano kun wuwaco botgi ni, ‘Dano acel acel okel twone nyo romone, wek wunekgi kany ci wucam. Pe dok wubal inyim Rwot pi mwodo ringo ki remo.’” Pimeno dano acel acel okelo twone i wor meno ci gunekogi kunu. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Caulo ocano keno tyer pi Rwot; en aye keno tyer mukwongo ma en ocano pi Rwot.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Caulo dok owaco ni, “Wek walubu kor jo Piliciti i dyewor, wacit wayakgi nio ka piny oru. Pe wabiweko dano mo dong ma kwo.” Dano gugamo ni, “Tim gin ma i neno ni beri.” Ento ajwaka owaco ni, “Weku kong wapeny Lubanga ki kany.” <verse eid="1SA 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Ci Caulo openyo dog Lubanga ni, “Myero acit alub kor jo Piliciti? Ibimiyogi i cing jo Icrael?” Ento Lubanga pe odoke iye inino meno. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Ci Caulo owaco ni, “Wubin kany, wun lutel wi lwak ducu, wek wungi wuniang kit ma bal obino kwede tin. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Ci Caulo okwongo kwong ni, macalo Rwot ma laro jo Icrael tye makwoni, kadi ka bal man tye ikom woda Yonacan, ci en bito ada.” Ento pe tye ngat mo ma odoke iye ki ikin lwak. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Dok owaco bot jo Icrael ducu ni, “Wun wubiwale wubedo tungcel, an ki Yonacan wabiwale wabedo tungcel.” Ci lwak guwaco bot Caulo ni, “Tim gin ma i neno ni ber ki tung boti.” <verse eid="1SA 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Wel 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:6">1 Cam 28:6</ref></char></note> Ma omiyo Caulo owaco ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, pingo tin pe i dok ikwaca, ladita? Kace bal man tye ikoma nyo ikom Yonacan ma wodani, ai Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, ci imii lagam ki Urim, ento ka bal man tye ikom joni Icrael, ci imii lagam ki Tumim.” Ci kwir omako Yonacan ki Caulo, kun lwak obwot. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Caulo dok owaco ni, “Wubol kwir ikin an ki woda Yonacan,” ci kwir opoto omako Yonacan.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Caulo dok owaco bot Yonacan ni, “Tita gin ma itimo,” ci Yonacan otito bote ni, “Abilo moo kic manok ki iwi odoo ma onongo amako i cingani. An dong atye ene, abito dong.” <verse eid="1SA 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Ci Caulo owaco ni, “Lubanga omyero oket can ikoma kitmeno ki makato bene ka pe kineki woko, Yonacan.” <verse eid="1SA 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Ento lwak gugamo dog Caulo ni, “Yonacan bito dong ada, ma otiyo matek me kelo ki Icrael loc man maditi? Pe twero time! Macalo Rwot tye makwoni, wa yer wiye mo acel pe bipoto i ngom, pien obedo katic kacel ki Lubanga inino man.” Ci lwak gularo Yonacan, omiyo pe kineke. <verse eid="1SA 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Kitmeno Caulo oweko ryemo kor jo Piliciti, ci odok cen; ki jo Piliciti bene gudok woko i kabedogi.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Caulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Ka Caulo dong otyeko camo ker pa jo Icrael me bedo rwot, en obedo kalweny ikom lumeroke ducu ma gurume. Olwenyo ikom jo Moab, jo Ammon, jo Edom, ikom luker me Joba ki ikom jo Piliciti. Kama Caulo oloke odok iye ducu, onekogi marac. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Obedo kalweny matek, oloyo wa jo Amalek, ci olaro jo Icrael ki i cing jo mayam gubedo kayakogi.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Caulo yam tye ki awobene Yonacan, Icivi, Malkicua. Nying anyirane ene: latin nyako mukwongo nyinge Merab ki nying matidine Mikal. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Nying dako pa Caulo onongo Akinoam, nya pa Akimaj. Nying ladit wi monye onongo Abneri wod pa Ner, ma omin won Caulo. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Kic en aye won Caulo, ki Ner ma won Abnerini onongo en aye wod pa Abiel.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Lweny obedo magwa ikom jo Piliciti ikare pa Caulo ducu. Ka Caulo oneno dano mo ma oteka lweny, ci kelo en, bedo ikin lumonye.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Lweny ikom jo Amalek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 10:1">1 Cam 10:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Camuel owaco bot Caulo ni, “Rwot yam ocwala kawiro in ki moo ker me bedo rwot maloyo jo Icrael, ma omiyo i tim ber iwiny lok pa Rwot. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:8-14">Nia 17:8-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 25:17-19">Nwo 25:17-19</ref></char></note>Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, ‘Abiketo can ikom jo Amalek pi gin mayam gutimo ikom jo Icrael, pien yam gulwenyo kwedgi ma gitye i yoo, ikare ma gua ki i Ejipt. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Cit ilweny ki jo Amalek, idyergi i cing Rwot, ijwergi woko liweng ki gin ducu ma gitye kwede. Pe kica omaki ikomgi, ento inek co wa ki mon, lutino wa ki gin ma pud dot, twoni ki romi, kinaga wa ki kanagu.’”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Caulo olwongo dano kalweny, ci okwanogi i Telaim. Jo ma giwoto ki tyen gi onongo gin romo alip miya aryo, ki jo pa Juda alip apar. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Ka Caulo obino inyim taun madit pa jo Amalek, ci obutu i nota, okurugi iye. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Dok Caulo owaco bot jo Kenit ni, “Wua, wucit woko ki ikin jo Amalek, wek pe atyekwu woko kacel kwedgi; pien yam kica omakowu ikom jo Icrael ducu ikare ma gua woko ki i Ejipt.” Ma omiyo jo Kenit gua woko ki ikin jo Amalek. <verse eid="1SA 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Caulo oloyo jo Amalek cake ki i Kavila nio kwede wa i Cur macok ki lobo Ejipt tung kunyango. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Omako Agag rwot pa jo Amalek otere makwo, ci odyero jo meno, ojwerogi woko ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Ento Caulo ki lwak kica omakogi ikom Agag, ci guweko en kacel ki romigu ma gibeco, ki twoni, ki roci mucwe, ki lutino romigu, ki jami mukene ma gibeco ducu, pe guye ni myero kijwergi woko liweng. Gin ducu ma kicayo, ki gin maracune, gin aye gujwerogi woko.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga okwero Caulo me bedo rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Ka dong lok pa Rwot obino bot Camuel ni, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Atyeko ngut pi miyo Caulo bedo rwot, pien obare woko ki kalubu kora odok woko cen, pe ocobo cika.” Ci kiniga omako Camuel, obedo ka kok bot Rwot dyewor benebene. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Camuel oa odiko con pi rwate ki Caulo. Ka gitito bot Camuel ni, “Caulo dong owoto i Karmel, ocibo gin me poo pire kene, ci oloke okato anyim, ocito wa i Gilgal.” <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Ka Camuel oo bot Caulo, ci Caulo owaco bote ni, “Gum pa Rwot obed ikomi. Atyeko cobo cik pa Rwot.” <verse eid="1SA 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Ci Camuel owaco ni, “Man dok kit koko romi ango ma awinyo ki i itani, ki koko dyangi ma awinyoni?” <verse eid="1SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Caulo owaco ni, “Gikelogi ki bot jo Amalek, pien dano gungoyo romi ki dyangi mabecone me gitum bot Rwot Lubangani; ki mudonge wajwerogi woko ducu liweng.” <verse eid="1SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Ento Camuel owaco bot Caulo ni, “Ling! Abititi gin ma Rwot otito bota tin dyewor.” Caulo ogamo ni, “Dong itit bota do.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Camuel owaco ni, “Kadi inen i wangi kekeni ni itidi, pe in aye iloyo kaka ducu ma i Icrael? Rwot yam owiri ki moo me bedo rwot pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Rwot ocwali kun waco boti ni, ‘Cit idyera jo Amalek ma lubalo, ijwergi woko ducu liweng.’ <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Pingo yam pe iworo dog Rwot? Pingo icore ikom gin ma giyako, ki timo gin manen marac iwang Rwot?” <verse eid="1SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Caulo owaco bot Camuel ni, “Atyeko woro dog Rwot. Acito kama kicwala iye, akelo Agag rwot me Amalek, dok ajwero jo Amalek woko ducu liweng. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Ento dano gukwanyo romi ki twoni ki i kin gin ma kiyako, gukwanyo gin mabecone ki ikin jami ma onongo kidyero me ajwera woko liweng, gutero wek gubed gitum bot Rwot Lubangani i Gilgal.” <verse eid="1SA 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Camuel ogamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">“Cwiny Rwot bedo yom i gitum awanga ki gityergu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">marom ki kit ma cwinye bedo yom kwede ka kiworo doge?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">Nen, woro dog Rwot ber kato gitum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">winyo cik ber kato dwolo nyogi romi ma kiwango me gityer.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Pien jemo rom ki bal me tyet,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">tekwic rom ki bal me woro cal jogi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">Macalo in ikwero winyo lok pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">en dong okwero in me bedo rwot.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Caulo owaco bot Camuel ni, “Apoto i bal, pien akalo wi cik pa Rwot ki wi loki, pien onongo alworo lwak, aworo doggi. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Dong kombedi alegi ni itima kica ikom bala, ci wadok kwedi wek acit awor Rwot.” <verse eid="1SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Camuel ogamo dog Caulo ni, “Pe abidok kacel kwedi, pien ityeko kwero lok pa Rwot woko, ki Rwot bene otyeko kwero in me bedo rwot pa jo Icrael.” <verse eid="1SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 28:17">1 Cam 28:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:30-31">1 Luk 11:30-31</ref></char></note>Ka Camuel oloke me cito woko, Caulo omako dog kanyi pa Camuel, ci kanyi oyec woko. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Camuel owaco bote ni, “Rwot dong oyeco ker pa Icrael woko ki boti tin, dong otyeko miyone bot lawoti ma en ber makato in. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Lubanga ma en Deyo pa Icrael pe biloko goba, kadi ngut bene; en pe dano ma kono onguti.” <verse eid="1SA 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Caulo owaco ni, “Apoto i bal; ento tin kong iket deyo ikoma inyim ludongo pa lwaka ki inyim jo Icrael, wek wadok kwedi, acit awor Rwot Lubangani.” <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Ma omiyo Camuel odok cen olubu kor Caulo, ci Caulo oworo Rwot.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Camuel dok owaco ni, “Kela Agag, rwot pa jo Amalek, bota kany.” Agag ocako bino bote ma tipu kome peke kun waco ni, “Ada man aye lit pa to?” <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Camuel owaco ni, “Kit mayam pala lucwani omiyo mon gudong labongo lutinogini, kitmeno meni bene bibedo labongo latin ikin mon wade.” Ka dong Camuel ongido Agag woko matinotino inyim Rwot i Gilgal.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Lacen Camuel odok i Rama; Caulo ocito mere i ode matye i Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Camuel pe omedo ki neno Caulo nio wa inino ma Caulo oto iye. Ento Camuel obedo kakumu pi Caulo. Ci Rwot ongut pi keto Caulo me bedo rwot pa jo Icrael.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Kiwiro Daudi me bedo rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Rwot owaco bot Camuel ni, “Cwinyi bikumu pi Caulo pi kare marom mene, kun an dong atyeko kwero en woko me bedo rwot pa jo Icrael? Pik moo i tung dyang, ci icit bot Yece ma jo Beterekem, pien anongo rwot pira kena ikin awobene.” <verse eid="1SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Camuel ogamo ni, “Abiwot kunu ningning? Ka Caulo biwinyone, ci bineka woko.” Rwot owaco bote ni, “Cit ki roya kun iwaco ni, ‘Abino katyero gitum bot Rwot.’ <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Ci ilwong Yece obin i ka tumu gitum. An abinyuti gin ma myero itii. Ibiwiro pira kena dano ma abitucu nyinge boti.” <verse eid="1SA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Camuel otimo kit ma Rwot ocikeni, ocito i Beterekem. Ludongo ma i taun madit meno gucito ka jolo wiye kun komgi myel. Guwaco ni, “Ibino ki kuc bo?” <verse eid="1SA 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Ci en ogamo ni, “Abino ki kuc. Abino ka tyero gitum bot Rwot. Wulonye kekenwu wubed maleng, ka wubin kacel kweda katyero gitum.” Olonyo Yece ki awobene gubedo maleng ci olwongogi i katyero gitum.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Ka gubino, Camuel oneno kom Eliab ci otamo ni, “Ada, ngat ma Rwot biwiro ki moo tye inyime.” <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Ento Rwot owaco bot Camuel ni, “Pe ibed kaneno ber me kome nyo kit bore, pien atyeko kwero en woko; pien Rwot pe neno piny kit ma dano nenoni. Dano neno kome ki woko, ento Rwot neno cwinye.” <verse eid="1SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Yece dok olwongo Abinadab, oweko en okato ki inyim Camuel; ci Camuel owaco ni, “Kadi man bene Rwot pe oyero.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Yece dok oweko Cama okato ki kangete; Camuel dok owaco ni, “Kadi man bene pe Rwot oyero.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yece omiyo awobene abiro ducu gukato inyim Camuel. Ci Camuel owaco bot Yece ni, “Rwot pe oyero joni.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Dok openyo Yece ni, “Awobeni ducu gitye kany?” Ci en ogamo ni, “Matidine aye pud odong; ento en tye ka kwayo romi,” ci Camuel owaco bot Yece ni, “Cwal kwena kiome; pien pe wabibedo piny nio ka en oo kany.” <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Ci Yece ocwalo kwena, ci kikele. Otuc ma kome kwar, wange mwonya ma neno ber. Rwot owaco ni, “Man aye en, dong ia malo, i wire ki moo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Camuel okwanyo tung dyang ma moo tye iye, owiro Daudi ki moo ki i dye omegine. Ci Cwiny pa Rwot obino ikom Daudi ki tek cake inino meno. Lacen Camuel oa odok i Rama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi ogoyo opuk pi Caulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Ikare meno Cwiny pa Rwot oa woko ki ikom Caulo, ci cen marac ma oa ki bot Rwot opoto ikome, obedo ka lanye. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Lutic pa Caulo guwaco bote ni, “Nen ba, cen marac ma oa ki bot Lubanga opoto ikomi, obedo kalanyi. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Laditwa, ber icikwa wan lutici ma watye kany wek wacit wayeny dano mo ma ladiro goyo opuk; ci ka cen marac ma a ki bot Lubanga opoto ikomi, en bigoyo opuk, miyo ibedo maber.” <verse eid="1SA 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Ma omiyo Caulo ociko lutice ni, “Wun wucit wuyenya dano mo ma ngeyo goyo opuk mabere, ci wukel en bota.” <verse eid="1SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Ngat acel ikin awobene ogamo ni, “Nen ba, aneno wod pa Yece ma Labeterekem ma ladiro goco. En laco ma oteka ma ongiyo ki lweny, ngeyo lok maber, dok nen mwonya, ki Rwot bene tye kwede.” <verse eid="1SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Ma omiyo Caulo ocwalo lukwena bot Yece kun waco bote ni, “Cwala wodi Daudi ma lakwat romini.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Yece okwanyo kana me yeyo mugati, ki opiru kongo bwino, ki latin dyel, ci ocwalogi bot Caulo kacel ki wode Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Ka Daudi ocito bot Caulo ci ocako tice, Caulo ocako mare matek tutwal, ka odoko lamak jami lwenye. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Caulo ocwalo kwena bot Yece kun waco bote ni, “Wek Daudi obed dong katiyo tic bota, pien aneno tice, oyomo cwinya.” <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Ikare ducu ma cen marac ma a ki bot Lubanga opoto ikom Caulo, ci Daudi kwanyo opuk, cako goyone, miyo Caulo bedo maber, doko dano, ci cen marac aa woko ki ikome.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Goliac otayo jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Ikare meno jo Piliciti gucoko monygi kacel pi lweny. Gucoke i Coko i lobo pa Juda, ci gugony ikin Coko ki Ajeka, i Epec-damim. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Caulo ki jo Icrael gucoke kacel, gugony i nota Ela, ci gin oyube me lweny ikom jo Piliciti. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Lupiliciti gucung iwi got tungcel, ki jo Icrael gucung iwi got tung mukene, kun nota tye ikin gi. <verse eid="1SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Ci twon oteka lweny mo obino ma oa ki i gony pa Lupiliciti ma nyinge Goliac, dano me Gat. Bore kato ka puti abongwen. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Oruku otang mola i wiye, dok oruku koti mola lageng kore; pek pa koti molane onongo romo kilo pyere abicel. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Oruku mola ma okwako tyene, kun okace ki tong alwiro mola iwi gwoke. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Bol tonge mito rom ki rii yat me cweyo bongo; lak tonge peke romo kilo abiro, kun lamak kwote otelo nyime. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />En ocung ci odange matek iwi mony pa jo Icrael ma gurye i tyeng ni, “Kara wubino ma wurye i tyeng pi lweny pingo? Pe an Lapiliciti? Pe wun lutic pa Caulo bo? Wuyer danowu mo acel, wek en olor piny obin bota. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Ka en twero lweny kweda ce oneka, ci wan wabibedo luticwu; ento ka an aye aloye, ce aneke, ci wun wubibedo luticwa pi tiyo tic botwa.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Lapiliciti meno dok owaco ni, “Atayo mony pa jo Icrael ma tin gurye i tyengi! Wumiya dano mo wek walweny kwede kacel.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Ka Caulo ki jo Icrael ducu guwinyo lwak lok pa Lapiliciti meno, ci cwinygi obale woko, gubedo ki lworo madwong tutwal.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi obino i gony pa lumony</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Daudi obedo wod pa dano mo me Eprata ma gange tye i Beterekem i lobo Juda; nyinge Yece, yam tye ki awobene aboro. Ikare pa Caulo, onongo en dong otii woko, mwaka me dite dong dwong. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Onongo awobe pa Yece adek ma muteggine gulubu kor Caulo i mony, nying awobene adek ma gucito i monyi gin ene: Eliab ma latin kayo, ki ma olube Abinadab, ki me adeke Cama. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Daudi aye matidine; jo ma otegi adeki gulubu kor Caulo, <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />ento Daudi obedo kawire bot Caulo, ka dok paco ka kwayo romi pa wone i Beterekem. <verse eid="1SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Lapiliciti obedo kabino anyim ci cung kunu odiko ki otyeno pi nino pyere angwen.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Yece owaco bot wode Daudi ni, “Ber iter nyig bel ma gicelo acelani bot omegini, maromo agwata adek, kacel ki mugati man apar, iting itergi oyot bot omegini ma gitye i gony ca. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Dok iter cak mutwo ma olungeni apar bot laditgi me mony maloyo dano alip. Nen kit ma omegini tye kwede, ci imak gin mo idwog kwede ki botgi ma nyutuni gitye maber.”<verse eid="1SA 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Ikare meno onongo Caulo ki omegi pa Daudi wa ki jo Icrael ducu gubedo i nota Ela, kun gilwenyo ki jo Piliciti. <verse eid="1SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Daudi oa odiko con oweko romi bot lagwokone, ci ocako wot otero cam ma kiyubu kit macalo Yece ocike kwede oo i gony ma onongo mony dong cito ka rye i tyeng, kun girwayo me lweny. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Ci jo Icrael ki jo Piliciti gurwayo cok karomo; ma mony okeme ki mony wadi. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Daudi oweko jami i cing lagwok jami, ci ocito karye ikin mony. En omoto omegine ducu ka openyogi kit ma lweny tye kwede. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Ka pud en tye kalok kwedgi, ci twon oteka me Gat ma ikin mony pa Lupiliciti ma nyinge Goliac otuc kamaleng inyim mony pa jo Piliciti ma guryeyo, kun loko lok marom ki macon ca, ci Daudi owinyo loke.<verse eid="1SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Jo Icrael ducu guringo laco meno woko ka gunene, ci gubedo ki lworo matek. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Ci lwak jo Icrael guwaco ni, “Wuneno dano man ma obinoni? Ada, en obino katayo jo Icrael. Ka ngat mo oneko, rwot bimiye doko lalonyo madit, dok bimiine nyare bene wek obed dakone, dok bimiyo jo me ot pa wone pe dong giculu mucoro.” <verse eid="1SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Daudi owaco bot jo ma gucung kangete ni, “Gin ango ma kibitimo ka dano mo oneko Lapilicitini, wek okwany kwede cac woko ki ikom Icrael? Lapiliciti ma pe ngeyo Lubangani mono obedo anga, ma omyero obed kacayo Lubanga makwoni?” <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Ci lwak dok gudoke iye kun gitite ngo ma kibitimo ki dano ma oneke.<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Ka Eliab omin Daudi madite owinyo ka loko ki dano, kiniga omake ikome ci owaco ni, “Pingo ibino? Iweko romiwa manoki i tim bot anga? Angeyo eteni ki bwola me cwinyi; ibino kany kaneno lweny.” <verse eid="1SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Daudi ogamo ni, “Atimo gin ango kombedi? Pud aloko aloka keken do.” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Ci oloke openyo ngat mukene lakit peny aceli. Dano ducu gudoke iye calo ngat mukwongoni.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Ka lok ma Daudi obedo ka lokoneni owinye, gutito bot Caulo; ci Caulo ocwalo kwena olwonge. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Daudi owaco bot Caulo ni “Pe iwek cwiny dano mo opoti pi Lapiliciti man ladit, an abicito kalweny kwede.” <verse eid="1SA 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Caulo owaco bot Daudi ni, “In pe itwero cito kalweny ki Lapiliciti man, pien in pud latin awobi, en obedo lalweny wa ikatinone.” <verse eid="1SA 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Ento Daudi ogamo dog Caulo ni, “Ladit, abedo ka kwayo romi pa wora. Ka yam labwor mo obino, nyo nguu mukene, ce omako latin romo mo ki ikin romiwa, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />aryemo kore ci agoyo, alaro latin romo, akwanyo woko ki idoge. Kace otoke otinge ikoma, apoto ikome ci amako yer tike, agoyo aneko woko. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Ladit, an aneko labwor ki nguu mukene mapol. Lapilicitini ma pe ngeyo Lubanga bibedo marom ki ngat acel ikin gi. Nen, en dong ocayo mony pa Lubanga makwo woko.” <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Ci Daudi dok owaco ni, “Rwot yam olara ki i lwet cing labwor ki nguu mukene: en bilara bene ki i cing Lapiliciti man.” Caulo owaco bot Daudi ni, “Citi. Rwot aye obed kwedi!”<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Caulo oruku Daudi ki jami lwenye, oruku otang mola i wiye, ka oruke ki koti mola. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Daudi otweyo pala lucwan pa Caulo iwi jami lweny pa Caulo, otemo wot kwede ci pe otwero, pien onongo pe ongiyo wot kwede. Ci owaco bot Caulo ni “An pe atwero wot ki jami lweny man ducu pien pe angiyo kwede.” Ci olunyugi woko, <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />ka okwanyo odoone omako i cinge, ci oyero lutino gweng abic ma olunge mapwot ki i laora kulu, opikogi i opiru kwate, ma ikicaane; ci omako latangdingone i cinge, ka onyiko cok bot Lapiliciti.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi oloyo Goliac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Lapiliciti obino onyiko cok ki Daudi ki lating kwote inyime. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Ka Lapiliciti oneno kom Daudi, ci otugi cayone woko, pien onongo pud latin awobi, kome kwar, dano ma neno mwonya. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Owaco bot Daudi ni, “An adoko gwok bo, ma omiyo ibino bota ki odooni?” Ka ocako ceno Daudi ki nying lwak lubangane. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Lapiliciti dok owaco bot Daudi ni, “Bin bota ci abimiyo ringo komi bot winyo me polo ki bot nguu ma i tim.” <verse eid="1SA 17:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Daudi bene owaco bot Lapiliciti ni, “In ibino bota ki pala lucwan, tong ki tong alwiro, ento an abino boti i nying Rwot me mony, i nying Lubanga me mony pa jo Icrael ma ibedo kacayoneni. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Tin Rwot bimiyo in i cinga, abireti woko piny, ci angolo wii woko; dok abimiyo kom lumony pa Lupiliciti ma guto tin bot winyo me polo ki bot nguu ma wi lobo, wek lobo ducu onge ni, Lubanga tye i Icrael, <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />dok wek lwak man gunge ni, Rwot pe laro dano ki pala lucwan kadi ki tong, pien lweny Rwot aye maloyo gire, ci en bimiyowu i cingwa.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Goliac oa obino karomo ki Daudi, ci Daudi oringo oyotoyot inyim mony ma orye i tyeng pi romo kwede. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Ci orwako cinge i opirune, okwanyo lagweng, obayo, ocelo tur nyim Goliac. Lagweng odonyo woko i tur nyime ci opoto piny aryeba cwiny.<verse eid="1SA 17:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 21:19">2 Cam 21:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kitmeno Daudi oloyo Goliac ki latangdingo ki lagweng, ma ocele kwede, oneke woko. Pala lucwan onongo peke i cing Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:9">1 Cam 21:9</ref></char></note>Ci Daudi oringo, ocung iwi Goliac, owoto pala lucwan pa Goliac ki i akurane, oneke kwede, ka ongolo kwede wiye woko. Ka jo Piliciti guneno ni twon oteka lweny monygi dong oto, ci guringo woko. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Lwak jo Icrael ki Juda gutware ki oduru gulubu kor jo Piliciti nio wa i Gat, ki i dog gang me Ekron. Omiyo Lupiliciti ma ret omakogi gupoto woko i dog yoo cake ki i Caaraim nio wa i Gat ki Ekron. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Lacen jo Icrael gucako dwogo cen ki karyemo Lupiliciti, ci guyako gonygi. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Daudi okwanyo wi Goliac okelo i Jerucalem, ento oketo jami lwenye i kemane.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ginyutu Daudi bot Caulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Ka Caulo oneno ka Daudi cito kalweny ki Goliac, ci openyo Abneri ma ladit wi monye ni, “Abneri, latin awobini wod pa anga?” Abneri ogamo doge ni, “Macalo in ikwoni, rwot, pe angeyo.” <verse eid="1SA 17:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Rwot dok owaco ni, “Peny pi awobi man, ni en wod pa anga?” <verse eid="1SA 17:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Ka Daudi odwogo ki kaneko Lapiliciti, ci Abneri okwanye otere inyim Caulo, ki wi Goliac i cinge. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Caulo openye ni, “In i wod pa anga, latin awobi?” Daudi odok iye ni, “An a wod pa latici Yece ma Labeterekem.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yonacan ocike ki Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Ka dong Daudi otyeko lok ki Caulo, ci Yonacan wod pa Caulo omaro Daudi matek, macalo omaro kome kene. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Caulo otero Daudi inino meno bote, pe dok oweko Daudi odok i gang pa wone. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Yonacan oketo gicike ki Daudi, pien onongo maro Daudi kit macalo omaro kome kene. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Ci olunyo jore woko ki ikome, omiyo bot Daudi kacel ki jami lwenye, macalo pala lucwane, atum ki aterone ki del pyere. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Kama Caulo ooro Daudi iye ducu en cito, tiyo maber, ma omiyo Caulo okete me loyo lumonye. Ket man oyomo cwiny lwak ducu, dok oyomo cwiny lutic pa Caulo bene.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyeko ocako mako Caulo ikom Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Ka onongo gidwogo paco, ki kama Daudi oneko iye Goliac ni, ki acikari bene gidwogo gang mon gumol woko ki i taun ducu ma i Icrael ma kun giwero, gimyelo pi jolo rwot Caulo ki ajaa, ki wer me wayu pi yomcwiny, ki jami agoya me wer. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:11">1 Cam 21:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 29:5">29:5</ref></char></note> I wayogi mon guwero kun gileyo aleya ni, “Caulo oneko mere dano alip, ento Daudi oneko alip apar.”<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Lok man ocwero cwiny Caulo, ci kiniga omake matek tutwal. Ci owaco ni, “Mon man gubedo ka waco ni, Daudi oneko alip apar, ki tung bota giwaco ni alip keken, gin ango mukene ma en dok twero limo? Man dong odonge camo ker keken.” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Cake ikare meno, Caulo neno Daudi agaya.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Orwone cen marac oturu ki poto ikom Caulo, ci obedo ka poo ki lok i ode calo lapoya, kun onongo Daudi goyo opuk ikit me nino ducu. Caulo onongo tye ki tonge i cinge, <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />ci obayo Daudi ki tong, pien obedo ka tamo ni, “Wek acob Daudi, adi woko i kor ot.” Ento Daudi opange oloyo tyen aryo.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Caulo obedo ka lworo Daudi, pien Rwot onongo tye kwede, ento Rwot onongo oa woko ki bot Caulo. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Caulo okwanyo Daudi woko ki inyime, okete me bedo ladit lalo dano alip; ci obedo katelo nyim lwak ka gicito i mony. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Gin ducu ma Daudi tiyo en cobo maber, pien Rwot tye kwede. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Ka Caulo oneno ni gin ducu ma Daudi tiyo cobo maber tutwal, ci obedo ka lwore. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Ento jo Icrael ki jo Juda ducu gumaro Daudi pien obedo katelo nyimgi i lweny kama giwoto iye ducu.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi onyomo nya pa Caulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Caulo dok owaco bot Daudi ni, “Atye ki nyara madit Merab en. Abimiyo en boti wek obed dakoni. Kono keken ni, omyero ibed oteka lwenya, kun ilwenyo matek pi Rwot.” Caulo onongo obedo ka tamo ni, “Wek cinga pe opot ikome, kono cing jo Piliciti aye opot ikome.” <verse eid="1SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Daudi owaco ni, “An anga, ki kwarina jo mene, ki dogola pa kwaragi gin angagi ikin jo Icrael, mamiyo abedo cwar nya pa rwotni?” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Ento ka kare me miyo Merab bot Daudi oromo, ci dok kimiyo Merab bot Adriel aye ma jo Mekola pi bedo dakone.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Mikal nya pa Caulo omaro Daudi mada. Ka gitito bot Caulo, ci loke oyomo cwiny Caulo. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Caulo onongo otamo ni, “Wek amii Mikal bot Daudi, wek obed owic me make, wek cing jo Piliciti aye opot ikome.” Ma omiyo Caulo dok owaco bot Daudi tyen me aryo ni, “In dong ibibedo cwar nyara.” <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Caulo oloko ki lutice bene, ocikogi ni, “Wulok ki Daudi i mung ni, ‘Nen, cwiny rwot yom ikomi, ki lutice ducu gimari; dong ibed cwar nya pa rwot.’” <verse eid="1SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Ci lutic pa rwot guwace lok meno ducu. Daudi ogamo ni, “Lok me doko cwar nya pa rwot nen ki botwu ni tidi mono, kun an lacan, ma peya aywek?” <verse eid="1SA 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Lutic pa Caulo gutito bote lok ma Daudi owaco. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Ci dok Caulo owaco lok ni, “Wubiwaco bot Daudi ni, ‘Rwot pe mito lim me nyom. En mito del kom nyim jo Piliciti me co miya acel, wek icul kwor ikom lumerok pa rwot.’” Onongo Caulo otamo ni, jo Piliciti aye omyero gunek Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Ka lutice gutito lok man bot Daudi, ci lok me bedo cwar nya pa rwot oyomo cwinye. Ci ma peya kare ma kimoko okato, Daudi ocito ki lwake, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />oneko jo Piliciti miya aryo, odwogo ki del kom nyimgi me co, ci omiyogi bot rwot kun mo pe orem, wek edok cwar nya pa rwot. Ci Caulo omiyo Daudi nyare Mikal me bedo dakone. <verse eid="1SA 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Ento ka Caulo oneno dok oniang maber ni Rwot tye ki Daudi, dok ni jo Icrael ducu gimare, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />lworo omako Caulo ikom Daudi makato yam con, ma omiyo Caulo obedo lamerok pa Daudi cake ikare meno.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Rwodi pa jo Piliciti dok gubino kalweny, ci ikare ducu ma gibino, nongo Daudi loyogi maber makato lutic pa Caulo mukene ducu, ma omiyo nyinge oywek matek.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Caulo otemo neko Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Caulo ocako loko ki wode Yonacan ki lutice ducu ni omyero kinek Daudi woko. Ento cwiny Yonacan wod pa Caulo onongo maro Daudi matek. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Yonacan otito bot Daudi ni, “Wora tye kayenyo yo me neki woko; pieno omyero igwok komi diki odiko, bed ma ikane keni i mung. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />An abicito i bar, acung inget wora kama ikane iyeni, ci abiloko piri bot wora; ka aniang lok mo, ci abitito boti.” <verse eid="1SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Yonacan oloko pi Daudi mamit bot wone Caulo kun waco ni, “Rwot, pe i tim bal ikom latici Daudi, pien pe otimo bal mo ikomi, obedo ka timi tic ducu mabeco. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Yam odyero kwone, oneko Goliac ma Lapiliciti, ci Rwot omiyo jo Icrael oloyo loc madit. Yam ineno, cwinyi obedo yom iye. Pingo imito timo bal kun ioyo remo pa dano ma pe ki bal, pi neko Daudi nono labongo tyen lok mo?” <verse eid="1SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Caulo owinyo dog wode Yonacan, ci okwongo kwong ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwoni, pe dong abineko Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Yonacan olwongo Daudi, otito bote lok meno ducu, ci okelo Daudi bot Caulo, omede ki tic inyime kit macon.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Lweny dok ocake. Ci Daudi ocito olwenyo ki jo Piliciti, onekogi mapol, omiyo guringo woko.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Ikare meno cen marac dok oa ki bot Rwot opoto ikom Caulo, ikare ma en obedo i ode ki tonge i cinge, kun Daudi tye ka goyo opuk. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Caulo oyube me guru Daudi i kor ot ki tong doki; ento Daudi ongeyo tam pa Caulo woko, ci owene woko omiyo Caulo ocobo kor ot ki tonge. Daudi oringo woko, ci obwot gire.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 59:3">Jab 59:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>I dyewor meno Caulo ocwalo lukwena ka kuru Daudi i ode, wek enek woko odiko, ento Mikal dako pa Daudi owaco bote ni, “Ka tin dyewor pe igwoko komi, ci gibineki woko diki.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Kitmeno Mikal ocwalo Daudi owok ki iwang dirica, ci en oringo woko obwot gire. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Mikal okwanyo cal apaya opyelo iwi kitanda pa Daudi, ka oketo laten wic me yer dyegi opyelo ka wiye, ka oumu woko ki bongo. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Ka Caulo ocwalo lukwena me omo Daudi, Mikal owaco botgi ni, “Kome lit.” <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Caulo dok ocwalo lukwena kaneno Daudi kun waco ni, “Wutinge ki kitanda wukel bota, wek aneke woko.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Ka lukwena gudonyo i kicika, ci nen, cal apaya aye tye iwi kitanda, ki laten wic me yer dyegi ka wiye. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Caulo openyo Mikal ni “Pingo ibwola kit man iweko lameroka ocito?” Mikal odok iye bot Caulo ni, “En owaca ni, ‘Wek aciti; ka pe, ci aneki woko.’”<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Ikare meno Daudi oringo obwot gire, ci ocito bot Camuel i Rama, otite gin ducu ma Caulo otimo ikome. Ci en kacel ki Camuel gucito gubedo i Nayot. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Dok kitito bot Caulo ni, “Daudi tye i Nayot i Rama.” <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Ci Caulo dok ocwalo lukwena kaomo Daudi. Ka lukwena pa Caulo guneno lwak lunebi ma gitito lok pa Lubanga, kun Camuel ocung katelo wigi, ci Cwiny pa Lubanga opoto ikom lukwena pa Caulo, gin bene gucako tito lok pa Lubanga macalo lunebi. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Ka kitito loke bot Caulo, ci dok ocwalo lukwena mukene. Gin bene gucako tito lok pa Lubanga kit macalo lunebi gititoni. Caulo dok ocwalo lukwena tyen me adeke, gin bene gutito lok pa Lubanga aye. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Ka lacen Caulo kikome ocito i Rama, obino kama wang pii madit tye iye matye i Cekuni, ci openyo ni, “Camuel ki Daudi gitye kwene?” Ngat acel owaco ni, “Gitye i Nayot, i Rama.” <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Caulo oa ki kunu, ocito i Nayot ma i Rama. Cwiny pa Lubanga obino opoto ikome bene, obedo kawot kun tito lok pa Lubanga macalo lanebi, kun woto oo kwede wa i Nayot ma i Rama. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:11-12">1 Cam 10:11-12</ref></char></note>En bene ocako lunyu bongone woko, otito lok pa Lubanga macalo lanebi inyim Camuel. Obutu munero inino meno dyeceng ki dyewor benebene. Ma omiyo giwaco ni, “Caulo bene odoko lanebi bo?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yonacan okonyo Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Daudi olwi oringo woko ki i Nayot ma i Rama, ocito bot Yonacan ci owaco ni, “An atimo gin ango? Aroco gin ango? Abalo gin ango inyim woru ma omiyo en mito nekani?” <verse eid="1SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonacan ogamo ni, “Meno pe twero time! Pe myero ito. Nen; wora pe tiyo gin mo madit nyo matidi ma pe otito bota; ci lok ango mamiyo wora munga lok man? Pe tye kitmeno.” <verse eid="1SA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Ento Daudi odok iye ni, “Woru ngeyo maber ni dong ayomo cwinyi; dok en tamo ni, ‘Pe kiwek Yonacan onge lok man, wek pe obed ki kumu.’ Ento me adane, macalo Rwot tye makwo, dok macalo in bene i tye makwoni, an dong acok ki to.” <verse eid="1SA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonacan dok owaco bot Daudi ni, “Gin ducu ma iwaco abitiyo piri.” <verse eid="1SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:11">Wel 28:11</ref></char></note>Daudi ogamo dog Yonacan ni, “Nen, diki kibikwero karama me por dwe manyen; an pe myero akeng bedo ki rwot i dog cam. Ento wek kong acit, akane woko i bar nio wa inino me adeke iwi otyeno. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Ka woru bipenyo pira, ci iwac ni, ‘Daudi openya matek ni kiyene me cito wa i ganggi Beterekem oyotoyot, pien timo gitum tye ma bedo kunu i dogolagi mwaka ki mwaka.’ <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Kace ogamo ni, ‘Ber,’ ci abibedo maber; ento ka obedo ki kiniga, ci ber inge ni tim marac dong otyeko moko i cwinye. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Ma omiyo in myero itima ber, pien dong iketo gicike maleng ikin in ki an. Ento ka roc mo tye ikoma, ci in kikomi aye ineka, pingo iweko apoto i cing woru?” <verse eid="1SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonacan ogamo ni, “Pe twero time ikomi! Kace angeyo ni tim marac dong otyeko moko i cwiny wora, ci pe atito boti?” <verse eid="1SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Daudi dok owaco bot Yonacan ni, “Anga mono ma dong bitita ka woru ogami lok ki gero?” <verse eid="1SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Ci Yonacan owaco bot Daudi ni, “Bin wek wacit i bar.” Ci gin aryo ducu gucito i bar.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Yonacan owaco bot Daudi ni, “Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael obed caden ikinwa! Ka dong atyeko ngeyo tam pa wora, diki kaonyo, nyo inino me adeke, nen, ka tame ber ikomi in Daudi, ci abicwalo lok atito boti. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Ento ka wora mito timi marac, Rwot myero oket can ikoma kitmeno ki makato bene ka pe atito loke boti ci acwali woko cen wek icit giri maber. Rwot aye obed kwedi kit mayam obedo ki worani. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Kace pud atye makwo, ci ibed kweda ki mar pa Rwot ma pe lokeni, wek pe ato. <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:1">2 Cam 9:1</ref></char></note>Dok pe ikwany mari woko ki ikom jo me oda matwal. Kace Rwot bikwanyo lumeroki ducu ki i lobo, <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />pe iwek gicikewa wan kwedi otur. Kace otur, Rwot biculu kwor ikomi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Ci Yonacan dok omiyo Daudi okwongo kwong kun ocike kwede pi mare, pien Yonacan onongo maro Daudi kit ma maro kwede kwone kekene.<verse eid="1SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Yonacan dok owaco bot Daudi ni, “Diki karama me por dwe. In dong ibibedo peke, ci kom bedoni bidong nono. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Inino me adeke kibipenyo piri matek; in dong icit i kabedo kama yam ikane iye ikare ca, ci ibed inget got ma kiguruni. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />An abibayo atero adek kangete manen calo abicelo gin mo. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Nen, abicwalo latin awobi kun awaco ni, ‘Cit kayenyo atero.’ Kace awaco bot latin awobi meno ni, ‘Nen, atero tye tung boti kany, putgi woko,’ ci in ibidwogo, pien macalo Rwot tye makwoni, nongo gin mo pe ma bitimi marac. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Ento ka awaco bot awobi ni, ‘Nen atero tye wa inyimi kuca,’ ci pe idwog cen, pien nongo Rwot aye ocwali woko cen. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Dok lok ma in ki an watyeko lokone, nen, Rwot tye ikin in ki an matwal.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Kumeno Daudi okane woko i bar. Ka kwero karama me por dwe ocake, ci rwot obedo piny kacam. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Caulo obedo ikome me nino ducu macok ki kor ot, ka Yonacan ocung okemo rwot, ki Abneri dok obedo kanget Caulo, ento kabedo pa Daudi onongo tye nono.<verse eid="1SA 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Caulo pe oloko iye gin mo inino meno, pien otamo ni, “Gin mo opoto ikom Daudi ma omiyo odoko keni, ci oweko en pe tye kakwero karama.” <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Ento inino me aryo me karama me por dwe, kom bedo pa Daudi obedo nono, ci Caulo ocako penyo wode Yonacan ni, “Pingo wod pa Yece pe obino ka cam, cake wa laworo ki tin bene?” <verse eid="1SA 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonacan ogamo dog Caulo ni, “Daudi openya matek ni kiyene me cito Beterekem. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Olega ni, ‘Wek acit, pien jo me dogolawa gitye katumu gitum i gang, omera ociko ni abed kunu. Kombedi, ka gum omaka inyimi, ci wek acit anen omegina.’ Pi lok meno omiyo en pe obino i dog cam boti, rwot.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Kiniga otugi mako Caulo ikom Yonacan cut. Ci owaco bote ni, “In i wod pa dako ma ngute oteng, ma lajemo; pe onongo an dong angeyo ni cwinyi otyeko maro wod pa Yece, ma lewice bimaki giri, ma lewice bimako wa meni bene? <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Teki wod pa Yece pud kwo iwi loboni, in pe ibibedo rwot matwal! Pieno cit ikele bota kany, pien en omyero oto.” <verse eid="1SA 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yonacan ogamo dog wone Caulo ni, “Kibineke woko pi gin ango? Otimo gin ango?” <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Ento Caulo obaye ki tong, ma omiyo Yonacan ongeyo ni cwiny wone otyeko moko pi neko Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Yonacan oa woko ki i dog cam ki kiniga madwong, ci pe dok ocamo cam mo inino me kwer me aryone, pien cwinye obedo kakumu pi Daudi, pien wone onongo oyeto Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Orwone Yonacan ocito i bar kama ocike iye ki Daudi, kacel ki latin awobi mo. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Ci owaco bot awobine ni, “Ring icit iput atero ma abibayoni.” Ka awobinu obiringo, ci obayo atero ocung wa inyime. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Ka latin awobi meno oo kama Yonacan obayo iye ateroni, Yonacan olwongo awobi meno kun waco ni, “Atero tye wa inyimi kuca.” <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Dok olwongo awobi meno kun waco ni, “Rune i tim oyoto, pe irii!” Awobi pa Yonacan ocoko atero ducu, odwogo kwedgi bot ladite. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Ento awobini pe ongeyo iye gin mo; kono Yonacan ki Daudi aye gin ongeyo loke. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Yonacan omiyo jamine ducu bot awobine, ocike ni, “Dong icit, idwokgi wa taun.” <verse eid="1SA 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Ka awobi meno ocito, ci Daudi otugi a malo ki inget got ma kiguruni, opoto i ngom aryeba cwiny inyim Yonacan, okulu wiye piny tyen adek. Gucako noto lemgi keken gi ki mot me mar, ka gukok ki pig wanggi keken gi ento Daudi aye obedo ki kumu madwong. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Yonacan dok owaco bot Daudi ni, “Cit giri ki kuc, macalo dong watyeko kwongo kwong kekenwa i nying Rwot, kun wawaco ni, ‘Rwot bibedo ikin an ki in, ki ikin likwaya ki likwayi matwal.’” Ka lacen Daudi oa opoke kwede, ci Yonacan odok i taun.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi oringo woko ki bot Caulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:3-4">Mat 12:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:25-26">Mar 2:25-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:3">Luk 6:3</ref></char>
    </note>Daudi ocito i Nob bot Akimelek ma ajwaka pa Lubanga, Akimelek obino kajolo wi Daudi ki myelkom kun penye ni, “Pingo itye keni ma ngat acel mo pe kacel kwedi?” <verse eid="1SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Daudi ogamo dog ajwaka Akimelek ni, “Rwot Caulo ocika ki lok mo kun waco bota ni, ‘Pe iwek ngat mo onge lok ma acwali pireni, ki lok ma aciki kwede.’ Pieno dong acike ki jona pi kabedo ma abirwate kwedgi iye. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Kombedi itye ki gin ango i cingi? Miya mugati abic, nyo gin mo keken matye boti.” <verse eid="1SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Ajwaka odok iye bot Daudi ni, “Pe tye mugati mo me nino ducuni i cinga, ento atye ki mugati maleng. Kace gin awobeni pe gubutu ki mon gi i kin kareni, ci atwero mini.” <verse eid="1SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Daudi ogamo dog ajwaka ni, “Me adane, gin pe gibutu ki mon gi ikare ducu ka wacito kamo iwot. Pimeno ka komgi dong bedo leng i wotgi me nino ducu, ci kombedi dong komgi pe twero bedo maleng makato ma kun tin wacito i lok ma pire teki?” <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-9">Lev 24:5-9</ref></char></note>Kitmeno ajwaka omiye mugati maleng; pien onongo mugati mukene peke bote, kono mugati me aketa inyim Lubanga keken aye kikwanyo ki inyim Rwot, ka kidwoko wange ki mugati manyen ma pud lyet inino meno kikome ma kikwanyoni.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Laco mo ma ikin lutic pa Caulo onongo tye kunu inino meno, ma obedo kalega inyim Rwot. Nyinge Doeg, Laedom, ma ladit pa lukwat pa Caulo.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Daudi dok owaco bot Akimelek ni, “Itye ki pala lucwan nyo tong mo kany? Pe akelo kadi pala lucwan kadi wa jami lweny mo, pien or pa rwot obedo me oyotoyot tutwal.” <verse eid="1SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:51">1 Cam 17:51</ref></char></note>Ajwaka ogamo kun waco ni, “Pala lucwan pa Goliac ma Lapiliciti mayam ineko i nota Ela aye tye kany, nen, tye ma kiboyo kome woko ki bongo kiketo inge epod. En ene; ka imito terone, ci ter do, pien mukene peke, enu keken aye tye kany.” Daudi owaco ni, “Miya, pe tye pala lucwan mo maber makato meno.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Daudi oa woko ki kunu inino meno kun ringo ki bot Caulo, ocito bot Akic, rwot me Gat. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:7">1 Cam 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 29:5">29:5</ref></char></note>Lutic pa Akic guwaco bote ni, “Man aye Daudi ma rwot me loboni. Yam mon guwero kun gimyelo kwede ma giwero ni, ‘Caulo oneko mere dano alip, ento Daudi oneko alip apar.’”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 56:5">Jab 56:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Daudi okano lok meno i cwinye, ci obedo ki lworo madwong ikom Akic, rwot me Gat. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:4-7">Jab 34:4-7</ref></char></note> Ci Daudi oloko kit bedone woko inyimgi pi lworo. Ocako poro bange woko ikin gi macalo lapoya, kun bedo kagoro kom kika me dogola ma i dog taun madit, dok weko laa doge mol i tike. <verse eid="1SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Ci Akic owaco bot lutice ni, “Nenu, laconi lapoya; pingo dok wukelo bota kany? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />An lupoya nok anoka bota bo, en ma omiyo wukelo laco man kanyutu apoyane inyima? Wumito ni laco man odony wa i oda?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Neko ajwaki pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 57:1-3">Jab 57:1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Daudi oa woko ki kunu, ocito i boro got matye Adulam. Ka omegine guwinyo pire, ki jo mukene me dogola pa kwarogi, ci gucito bote. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Wa ki dano ducu ma kidiyogi, dano ma gucamo banya, ki dano ma piny oloyogi, gucoke bote, ci Daudi odoko ladit ma loyogi, dano macok romo miya angwen.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Daudi oa ki kunu, ocito i Mijpa ma i lobo Moab. Ci owaco bot rwot me Moab ni, “Alegi iwek wora ki maa gubed boti, nio ka abingeyo gin ma Lubanga bitiyo ikoma.” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Ci Daudi owekogi bot rwot me Moab, ci gubedo kunu pi kare ducu ma Daudi tye ka kane i godi.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Lanebi Gad obino bot Daudi ci owace ni, “Pe ibed ka kane i godi, a woko, icit i lobo Juda.” Ma omiyo Daudi oa woko ki kunu, ocito i bunga Keret.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Inino mo acel Caulo onongo tye i Gibea, ite yat ananga ma i kabedo mutinge malo. Ka Caulo obedo piny kunu ki tonge i cinge, kun lutice ducu gucung cok kwede, owinyo ni kinongo kom Daudi ki jo ma gitye kwede. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Ci owaco bot lutice ma gucung ingete ni, “Tin wuwiny, wun jo pa Benjamin, Wutamo ni wod pa Yece bimiyo poto me apura bot ngat acel acel ikinwu, ki poto olok? En biketowu ducu wubedo lulo dano alip nyo lulo dano miya? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Man aye gin ma omiyo wun ducu wupiro lok ikoma? Pe tye ngat mo ma otito bota ni woda ocike ki wod pa Yece. Pe tye ngat mo ma cwinye paro pira. Ngati mo ma otita ni woda orubu cwiny dano mayam latica wek oliba, macalo en tye katimo inino man.” <verse eid="1SA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:7-9">1 Cam 21:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 52:1-5">Jab 52:1-5</ref></char></note>Doeg ma Laedom ogamo doge ki kama ocung ki iye kanget lutic pa Caulo ni, “An aye aneno wod pa Yece ka cito i Nob bot Akimelek wod pa Akitub, <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />ci Akimelek openyo dog Rwot pire, dok omiye cam, ki pala lucwan pa Goliac ma Lapiliciti.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Rwot Caulo ocwalo kwena pi lwongo ajwaka Akimelek wod pa Akitub ki ludogola pa kwarone ducu, gin ajwaki pa Lubanga ducu ma gitye i Nob; ci gin ducu gubino bot Caulo. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Caulo owaco ni, “Dong iwiny, in wod pa Akitub.” En ogamo ni, “An atye ene, rwoda.” <verse eid="1SA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Caulo openye ni, “Pingo wupiro lok ikoma, in ki wod pa Yece, dok imiye cam ki pala lucwan, ka dok ipenyo dog Rwot pire, omiyo obino kalweny ikoma ki kaliba, macalo en tye katimo ikareni?” <verse eid="1SA 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Akimelek ogamo dog rwot ni, “Rwot, anga ma ikin lutici ma lagen macalo Daudi? En obedo cwar nyari bene, dok ladit pa lugwok kwoni, dano ma kiworo mada i odi! <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Tin aye tyen mukwongo ma apenyo kwede dog Lubanga pire? Pe kumeno, ladit rwot, pe itam lok mo marac ikoma nyo ikom jo me dogola pa kwara, pien an pe angeyo lok mo wa ki acel ikom lok ma iwaconi.” <verse eid="1SA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Rwot Caulo owace ni, “Ibito ada, Akimelek, in kacel ki jo me dogolawu ducu.” <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Ci Caulo owaco bot jo ma gigwoke ma gucung cok kwede ni, “Wunek ajwaki pa Rwot woko, pien guribo cinggi ki Daudi. Gin ngeyo ni Daudi olwi woko, ci pe gutito bota.” Ento lutic pa rwot gukwero gudu kom ajwaki pa Rwot. <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Caulo dok owaco bot Doeg ma Laedom ni, “In aye inek ajwaki magi.” Ci Doeg ma Laedom oneko ajwaki ducu. Inino meno oneko dano pyere aboro wiye abic ma guruku epod me bongo camanini ma ajwaki pa Lubanga girukuni. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Caulo dok omiyo kineko dano ducu ma i Nob ma taun madit pa ajwaki. Kityekogi woko ducu ki pala lucwan, co ki mon, lutino adunu ki lutino lukere ma pud dot, kacel ki twoni dyangi ki kana ki romigu.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Ento ngat acel ki ikin awobe pa Akimelek wod pa Akitub obwot, nyinge Abiatar. Oringo olubu kor Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />En otito bot Daudi, kit ma Caulo oneko kwede ajwaki pa Rwot. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Daudi owaco bot Abiatar ni, “Onongo yam angeyo loke wa inino ca ma aneno Doeg ma Laedom kunu. Inino meno aniang ni en bitito bot Caulo. An aye akelo to man ikom dogola pa kwarowu. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Dong ibed kweda, pe ilwor, pien ngat ma mito neka nongo mito neko in bene. Ka ibedo kweda ci abigwoki maber.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi obedo i Keila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Kitito bot Daudi ni “Jo Piliciti gitye kalweny ikom jo Keila, gin yako kalgi woko ki i laro moyo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Pieno Daudi openyo dog Rwot ni, “Acit alweny ikom jo Piliciti meno?” Ci Rwot ogamo dog Daudi ni, “Cit ilweny ikom jo Piliciti wek ilar jo Keila.” <verse eid="1SA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Ento jo pa Daudi guwaco bote ni, “Nen, kany i Juda watye kabedo ki lworo madwong. Pe bedo rac mada ka dok wacito i Keila kalweny ki mony pa jo Piliciti?” <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Ci Daudi dok openyo dog Rwot odoco. Ci Rwot owaco bote ni, “A malo, icit i Keila pien abimiyo jo Piliciti i cingi.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Daudi ki jone gucito i Keila, gulwenyo ikom jo Piliciti, gudwogo cen ki dyangi, ma guyako ki guneko lwak jo mapol. Kitmeno Daudi olaro jo Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Ikare ma Abiatar wod pa Akimelek ringo laro bot Daudi i Keila, en ocito ki epod i cinge.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Kitito bot Caulo ni Daudi dong ocito i Keila. Ci Caulo ogamo ni, “Lubanga dong otyeko miyo Daudi woko i cinga, pien odonyo i taun matye ki dogola ma kicego ki rii, ci oloro iye wiye kekene.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Ci Caulo olwongo lwak ducu kalweny wek gucit i Keila ka rumu wi Daudi ki jone kunu. <verse eid="1SA 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Daudi oniang ni Caulo tye kapiro lok marac ikome, ci owaco bot ajwaka Abiatar ni, “Kel epod kany.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Ci Daudi olego ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, awinyo ni Caulo tye kayenyo yo me bino Keila wek etyek gang man woko pira. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Ci dong apenyo ni, jo Keila gin bimiya i cing Caulo? Caulo bibino, kit ma awinyoni? Ai Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, abako doga boti, tita ba.” Ci Rwot owaco bote ni, “En bibino.” <verse eid="1SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Daudi dok openyo ni, “Jo Keila gibimiya ki jona i cing Caulo?” Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Gin bimiyo in icing Caulo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Ci Daudi ki jo ma gitye bote, dano maromo miya abicel, gua woko ki i Keila, guket, gucito kama gin romo wot iye. Ka dok kitito bot Caulo ni, Daudi dong oringo woko ki i Keila, ci pe dong ocito kunu.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi obedo i tim i lobo godi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Daudi obedo kakane i dye tim, i lobo godi ma i tim Jip. Ci Caulo obedo kayenye jwijwi, ento Lubanga pe omiye i cinge.<verse eid="1SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Ikare ca, onongo Daudi bedo i Korec matye i tim Jip. Daudi obedo ki lworo pien onongo Caulo tye kayenye me aneka. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Ci Yonacan wod pa Caulo obino bote, ojingo cwinye i nying Lubanga kun waco bote ni, <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />“Pe ilwor, pien cing wora pe bipoto ikomi. Ibibedo rwot maloyo Icrael, an abibedo lalub kori. Wora Caulo bene ngeyo kumeno.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:3">1 Cam 18:3</ref></char></note>Ci gin aryoni ducu guketo gicikegi inyim Rwot. Lacen Daudi odong i Korec, ci Yonacan odok paco.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 54:3">Jab 54:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jo Jip gucito bot Caulo i Gibea, guwaco bote ni, “Daudi tye kakane ikinwa, i Korec, ikom got Kakila ma i Jecimon tung kupiny. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />In rwot bin dong, kit macalo cwinyi mito binoni, ci wan aye wabimiyo en i cingi.” <verse eid="1SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Caulo ogamo ni, “Rwot aye omii ki wun gum pien kica omakowu ikoma. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Wun wucit wupeny kakare maber wek wunge kabedo ma en bedo iye, ki ngat ma oneno en kunu; pien kitito bota ni en kwiri mada. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Kong wucit wunen, wungi kabedo ducu ma en maro kane iye, wek wudwog ma dong wuniang ma atir. Ka dong abicito kunu kacel kwedwu. Teke en tye i lobo man kamo, ci abiyenye ki ikin kaka ducu ma gitye i Juda.” <verse eid="1SA 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Ci gua gukwongo nyim Caulo gucito i Jip.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:24">Ikare meno onongo Daudi ki jone gitye i Maon, i Araba macok ki Jecimon, tung kupiny. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Caulo ocito kacel ki jone kayenye, ento gitito bot Daudi, omiyo ocito obedo i lung matut ikin godi ma i tim Maon. Ka Caulo owinyo pire, ci olubu kor Daudi wa kunu. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Caulo woto rabo nget lung tungcel kun Daudi ki jone onongo girabo nget lung tungcel. Daudi orune me a woko ki kanget Caulo, pien onongo jo pa Caulo gunyiko cok ki Daudi ki jone wek kimakgi woko. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Ci lakwena mo dok obino bot Caulo ma waco ni, “Rune ibin oyoto, pien jo Piliciti gubino ka monyo lobo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Caulo oa woko ki kalubu kor Daudi, ocito kalweny ki jo Piliciti; ma omiyo kicako nying kabedonu ni, Got me Bwot. <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Daudi oa ki kunu, ocito obedo i En-gedi kama en okane iye.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi oweko Caulo obwot ki i En-gedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Ka Caulo odwogo ki kalubu kor jo Piliciti, ci kitito bote ni, “Daudi tye i tim En-gedi.” <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Caulo ocoko dano alip adek ma kiyerogi ki ikin mony pa jo Icrael, ci ocito kwedgi kayenyo Daudi inyim godi ma kilwongo ni Dyegi tim. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 57:1-3">Jab 57:1-3</ref></char></note> Ci ocito kama dwol romi tye iye inget yoo, kama boro bene tye iye; ci Caulo ongak woko i boro kakonye. Onongo Daudi ki jone bene gin tye i boro meno, ki i tyelone. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Jo pa Daudi guwace ni, “Tin aye nino mayam Rwot owaci pire ni, ‘Nen abimiyo lameroki i cingi, in dong ibitime kit ma imito.’” Daudi oa malo okwale, ci ongolo dog bongo jor pa Caulo. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Lacen cwiny Daudi opoto, pien oniang ni etimo bal. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:11">1 Cam 26:11</ref></char></note>Ci owaco bot jone ni, “Lubanga okwero ni pe atim kit gin macalo man ikom rwoda ma en dano ma Rwot owiro; pe myero aket cinga ikome, pien Rwot dong owire woko.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Ci Daudi ojuku jone ki lok meno, en pe oye ni gulweny ikom Caulo. Caulo oa malo, okato woko ki i boro got, ci omede ki wote.<verse eid="1SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Lacen Daudi bene oa malo, ocito i dog boro, olwongo Caulo kun waco ni, “Rwoda ki rwota!” Ka Caulo oneno ngeye, ci Daudi okulu wiye piny i ngom, omiye woro. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Daudi owaco bot Caulo ni, “Ladita, pingo ibedo ka winyo lok pa jo ma giwaco ni atye kayenyi wek atimi rac? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Nen, ka tin Rwot omiyi i cinga i boro man, kun onongo jo mukene guwaco bota ni aneki woko. Ento an aye aweki omiyo ibwot. Awaco ni pe atwero keto cinga ikomi, rwoda, pien in dano ma Rwot owiro. <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Dong inen, wora, nen dog jori tye i cinga en. Nen, angolo dog jori ci pe aneki. Myero dong inge dok inen atir ni, pe atye ki gin mo marac nyo roro mo i cwinya. Pe atimo bal mo ikomi, kadi ka itye kayenya ma imito neka woko. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Ber Rwot aye ongol kop ikin an ki in, ber Rwot aye ocul kwora ikomi; ento cinga pe bigudu komi. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Kit ma carolok pa ludongo waco ni, ‘Jo ma lubal, bal bene a ki botgi’; ento pe abiketo can ikomi. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:20">1 Cam 26:20</ref></char></note>In rwot pa Icrael kulu ibino kalubu kor anga? Ilubu kor gwok ma oto? Kor ladep mamwa? <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Pieno Rwot Lubanga aye dong obed langolkop, en ongol kop ikin an ki in, onen kite, dok opid ma kakara, wek olara ki i cingi.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Ka Daudi otyeko waco lok meno ducu bot Caulo, ci Caulo openyo ni, “Meno dwoni bo, Daudi, latina?” Ci ocako koko kun waco bot Daudi ni, <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />“In cwinyi leng kato cwinya woko, pien itima maber kun an atimi marac. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Tin dong inyutu woko kamaleng kit ma itima kwede maber, en aye omiyo pe ineka ikare ma Rwot omiya woko i cingi. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Ada, ka dano mo onongo kom lameroke owec, ci biweko bwot ma pe oketo can ikome? Myero Rwot omiyi mot maber, kit macalo tin itimo kwede ikomani. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Tin dong angeyo ada ni, in ibibedo rwot, dok ker me Icrael bimoko matek i cingi. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Dong ikwonga kwong ki nying Rwot ni, pe ibijwero likwaya ma gin lubu ngeya woko, dok pe ibijwayo nyinga woko ki i dogola pa kwara.” <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Ci Daudi okwongo kwong kit ma Caulo onongo mitoni. Lacen Caulo odok paco, ento Daudi ki jone gudok i ka kanegi.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi ki Abigail</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Ka Camuel oto, ci jo Icrael ducu gucoke, gukumu pire, ci kiyike i gange ma i Rama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Lacen Daudi dok oa ocito i tim Paran. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Laco mo onongo tye kunu i Maon, ma tiyo tice i Karmel. Laco meno onongo lalonyo mada; tye ki romi alip adek ki dyegi alip acel. Ikare ca en obedo kangolo yer romine i Karmel. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Nying laco meno kilwongo ni Nabal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="fk">Nabal </char> tyen loke ni laming.</note>, ki nying dakone Abigail. En dako ma ngeyo piny mada, dok mwonya bene, ento cware aye lakolo dok ger. Dogolane jo pa Kaleb. <verse eid="1SA 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Ka Daudi owinyo ki i tim ni Nabal tye kangolo yer romine, <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />ci ocwalo awobe apar bote. Ocikogi ni, “Wucit i Karmel bot Nabal, wucwal mota bote, <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />wuwac bote ni, ‘Daudi omoti, owaco ni, kuc obed ikomi, omera, ki ikom jo me odi, ki jo ducu ma gitye boti. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Awinyo ni itye kangolo yer romini. Ikare ducu ma lukwat gubedo i Karmel wabedo kacel kwedgi. Pe watimogi marac, dok bene pe kikwalo gin mo ki botgi. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Peny awobeni, ci gibititi. Pieno wek awobena gunong gum boti tin, pien gubino inino me camo karama. Dong alegi imii botgi gin ma itwero nongo pirgi ki pira, an wodi Daudi.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Ka awobe pa Daudi guo kunu, guwaco lok meno ducu bot Nabal ma kaka Daudi; ci gubedo kakurune. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Ci Nabal odok iye bot lutic pa Daudi ni, “Daudi en anga? Anga ma wod pa Yeceni? Ikare man tye lwak lutic mapol ma gutenyo luditogi. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Ci an dok akwany mugatina ki piina, ki ringo ma aneko pi lungol yer romina, amii bot dano mo ata ma gua kama pe angeyoni?” <verse eid="1SA 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Pi lok meno awobe pa Daudi guloke gudok woko cen ci gutito lok man ducu bot Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Daudi owaco bot jone ni, “Dano acel acel otwe pala lucwane!” Ci dano acel acel otweyo pala lucwane ki Daudi bene otweyo mere. Jo miya angwen gucito i kor Daudi, kun jo miya aryo gudong kakuru jami.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Ento awobi mo acel otito bot Abigail dako pa Nabal kun waco ni, “Nen, Daudi ocwalo lukwena ki i tim gubino kamoto laditwa; ci en otuke ikomgi magwa, <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />kun kono joni giber ikomwa, pe wabedo ki can mo, ki gin mo pe orem botwa ikare ma watye i bar kwat, ikare ducu ma wawoto kacel kwedgi. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Gin aye gubedo celwa dyewor ki dyeceng bene ikare ducu ma wabedo kakwayo romi. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Ber in aye inge loki, wek inen gin ma myero i tim, pien can bipoto ikom laditwa ki ikom jo me ode ducu; en tye ki gero keken, ma dano mo pe twero lok kwede.”<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Ci Abigail oa malo liwic, okwanyo mugati miya aryo, opiru kongo bwino aryo, ringo romi abic ma kitedo, nyig bel ma kicelo aduku abic, tuga olok ma otwone miya acel ki poki otini ma otwone miya aryo, ci oketogi iwi kana wek guting. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />En owaco bot awobene ni, “Wucit wutel nyima, an abibino kun alubu korwu.” Ento pe otito loke bot cware Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Ci oito iwi kana, ocako wot, ci olor piny kama got ocego iye piny. Ci nen, Daudi ki lwake bene gitye ka lor piny gikemo en, ci en oromo kwedgi. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Onongo Daudi owaco ni, “Kara ada abedo kagwoko lim pa laconi i tim nono, ma kun jamine mo pe orwenyo ikom wadgi. En otima marac kun an atime maber. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Ci Lubanga myero oket can ikoma kitmeno ki makato bene, kace diki odiko aweko laco acel mo obwot ki ikom jo ma en tye kwedgini.”<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Ka Abigail oneno Daudi, ci orune, olor woko piny ki iwi kanane, opoto i ngom aryeba ic inyim Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Oryebe piny katyene kun waco ni, “Wek bal obed ikoma keken ladita. Alegi ni iwek kong alok kwedi mot, ladita, ci iwiny loka. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Pe ibed ka tamo lok pa Nabal, en dano ma kite rac. Kit ma nyinge tye kwede, kite bene tye kitmeno. Nabal aye nyinge, dok mingo bene oniang woko ikome. An onongo pe angeyo, ladit, pe aneno kom awobe ma icwalogi. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Kombedi, ladita, macalo Rwot tye makwoni, ki in kikomi bene itye makwoni, dong inen ba, Rwot otyeko juki woko ni pe icit iting alii me remo kun iculu kwor ki cingi kikome. Wek lumeroki ki jo ma gimito timi marac gubed macalo ladita Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Dong igam mot ma an latici akelo boti rwoda, wek kimii bene bot awobe ma gilubu kori. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Tima kica pi bala, ladit; pien Rwot bimiyo odi cung matek, pien itye kalweny pi Rwot, bal mo peke ma kibinongo ikomi ikare me kwoni ducu. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Kadi jo mapol gubin kalubu kori kun gimito neki woko, gin binongo kwoni kiboyo kome woko ikin boc pa jo makwo ma Rwot Lubangani aye gwokogi. En bibayo kwo pa lumeroki woko macalo kibayo latangdingo. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Ikare ma Rwot dong otiyo ikomi gin ducu maber ma oloko i komini, ladita, ma dong oketi me bedo laker maloyo jo Icrael, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />ci dong pe ibibedo ki gin mo mamiyo ikumu, kadi tam marac mo ma obino pien yam pe ioyo remo nono, onyo iculu kwori in ki komi. Ikare ma Rwot bitimi ber, ci ipo pira, ladit.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Ci Daudi owaco bot Abigail ni, “Kipwo Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, ma tin ocwali karwate kwedani! <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Kipwoyi bene pi tami ma olil, dok gum obed ikomi, pi ryekoni maber, ma omiyo ijuka tin, oweko pe atingo alii me oyo remo, ki pi culu kwora kekena ki cinga kikome! <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Ada, kit ma Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael tye makwoni, en dong ojuka, pe atimi marac. Kono in pe irune ibino irwate kweda, i ada kono laco mo acel pe obwot ki bot Nabal diki odiko.” <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Ci Daudi ogamo gin ma Abigail okelo, ci owaco bote ni, “Cit giri ki kuc idok i odi. Atyeko winyo dogi, dok ajolo legani.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Abigail ka odwogo bot Nabal, onongo tye kacamo karamane i ode, marom ki karama pa rwot kulu. Cwinye obedo yom matek pien onongo omer woko tutwal, omiyo Abigail pe otito lok mo bote nio ka piny oru. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Odiko ka kongo bwino dong oware woko ki i wiye, en otito lok ducu bote. Kom Nabal oto woko lirut, dok kome bene akweya ogoyo woko. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Ka nino okato apar, ci Rwot ogoyo Nabal oto woko.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Ka Daudi owinyo ni Nabal dong oto woko, ci owaco ni, “Kipwo Rwot ma oculu kwora pi anywar mayam alimo ki bot Nabal, dok ojuka pe atimo bal mo. Rwot odwoko bal pa Nabal i wiye gire!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Ci Daudi ocwalo kwena me cako cunane ikom Abigail wek obed dakone. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Ka lutic pa Daudi guo bot Abigail i Karmel, ci guwaco bote ni, “Daudi ocwalowa boti ni wacit kwedi wek icit ibed dakone.” <verse eid="1SA 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Ci Abigail oa malo oryebe piny i ngom, kun waco ni, “Nen, an angecane ma lalwok tyen lutic pa ladita.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigail orune oito iwi kanane, ocako wot i kor lukwena pa Daudi kacel ki anyirane abic ma konye, ci odoko dakone.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Onongo Daudi onyomo Akinoam me Jejreel bene, ci gin aryo ducu gubedo mone. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:14-16">2 Cam 3:14-16</ref></char></note>Ento onongo Caulo otyeko kwanyo nyare Mikal ma dako pa Daudi, omiyo bot Palti wod pa Laic ma bedo i Gallim.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi oweko Caulo obwot tyen me aryone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 54:3">Jab 54:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jo Jip dok gubino bot Caulo i Gibea, guwaco bote ni, “Daudi tye okane iwi got Kakila i Jecimon.” <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Caulo oa ocito i tim Jip ki mony pa jo Icrael ma kiyerogi maromo alip adek; gucito kayenyo Daudi i tim Jip. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Caulo ogony iwi got Kakila matye inget gudo i Jecimon; ento onongo Daudi tye mere i tim. Ka oneno Caulo olubu kore wa i tim, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />ci Daudi ocwalo lurotpiny kunu, ci gumoko atir ni Caulo obino ada. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Daudi oa obino i kabedo kama Caulo ogony iye, oneno kabedo ma Caulo obutu iye kacel ki Abneri wod pa Ner ma ladit maloyo monye. Caulo onongo obutu i kabedo ma kigengo ngete, kun mony ogure dyere.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Ci Daudi owaco bot Akimelek ma Lakit, ki Abicai ma omin Joab wod pa Jeruya ni, “Anga ma bicito kacel kweda i gony bot Caulo?” Abicai ogamo; “An aye abicito kacel kwedi.” <verse eid="1SA 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Daudi ki Abicai gucito i gony pa Caulo inino meno. Caulo onongo obutu i kabedo ma kigengo ngete, ki tonge ocung kangete ma kiguro i ngom. Abneri ki lumony gubutu gugure dyere. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abicai owaco bot Daudi ni, “Tin Lubanga omiyo lameroki i cing. Wek dong aneke woko kombedi kun agure woko ki tong pil wa i ngom kicel keken; pe abicobo tyen aryo.” <verse eid="1SA 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Ento Daudi owaco bot Abicai ni, “Wek nekone obedi. Anga matwero keto cinge ikom dano ma Rwot owiro ci pe bitingo alii?” <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Dok owaco ni, “Kit macalo Rwot tye makwoni, Rwot aye bipwode gire; nyo ka nino me tone biromo, nyo bicito i mony kamo, ci to ki kunu. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:6">1 Cam 24:6</ref></char></note>Rwot pe ye ni aket cinga ikom dano ma en owiro. Ento ber waput tonge matye ka wiyeni, ki opoko piine, wek wacit woko.” <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Kitmeno Daudi ocako putu tong pa Caulo, ka otingo opoko piine ma onongo tye ka wiye, ci gucito woko. Dano mo pe onenogi nyo ongeyo gin ma otime, ngat mo bene pe oco ki iwang nino; pien gin ducu gunino woko ki nino mapek ma oa ki bot Rwot.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Daudi obaro dye nota, okato tungcel, ci ocung ki kamabor iwi got, ma kin gi lac. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Ci Daudi ocako lwongo mony pa Caulo ki Abneri wod pa Ner kun waco ni, “Abneri, pe igamo doga ce?” Abneri ogamo ni, “In anga ma ilwongo rwotni?” <verse eid="1SA 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Daudi owaco bot Abner, “Pe in laco ce? Anga marom kwedi i Icrael? Ci pingo pe ibedo ka gwoko laditi ma rwotni? Pien dano mo obino wa botwu ka neko rwodi woko ki ikinwu. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Gin ma itimoni pe ber wa ki acel. Macalo Rwot tye makwoni, myero kineki woko, pien pe ibedo ka gwoko laditi, ma en aye dano ma Rwot owiro. Kombedi dong inen kama tong pa rwot tye iye, ki opoko piine ma onongo tye ka wiyeni!”<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Caulo ongeyo dwon Daudi woko ci owaco ni, “Man aye dwoni, Daudi, latina?” Daudi ogamo ni, “Eyo, meno aye dwona rwoda.” <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Daudi dok owaco ni; “Pingo ibedo kalubu kora, ladita? An mono atimo gin ango? Atingo kit alii ango? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Kombedi dong iwiny loka, ladita. Kace Rwot aye opiyo in ikoma, ci wek en ogam tyeri, ento ka dano aye gupiyo in, ci wek kicengi woko ki inyim Rwot, pien gutyeko ryema woko wek pe anywak bedo kwedgi i lobo ma Rwot omiyo botwa me aleyani, kun gin waco ni, ‘Cit woko wek itii ki lubanga mukenegu.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Kombedi pe iwek remona oony i ngom i lobo pa lurok kamabor ki inyim Rwot; pien rwot me Icrael obino kalubu kor ladep acel, macalo dano ma dwaro anyeri ikin godi.”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Caulo dok ogamo ni, “Atimo rac, dong idwog cen, Daudi latina, pe dong abitimi rac matwal, pien kwona tin obedo me wel inyimi. Nen, abedo kanyutu mingona, omiyo angak kamabor tutwal.” <verse eid="1SA 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Daudi ogamo ni, “Tongi dong enu, rwot! Wek ngat acel ki ikin awobeni obin kany ka omone. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Rwot culu dano ki acel acel kit ma cwinye atir kwede ki ma lubu kit gene; pien tin dong Rwot omiyo in i cinga, ci an pe atingo cinga aketo ikomi pien in i dano ma Rwot owiro. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Kit macalo tin kwoni obedo me wel inyimani, kitmeno kwona bene myero obed me wel inyim Rwot, dok myero en aye olara ki i aromana ducu.” <verse eid="1SA 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Caulo dok ogamo dog Daudi ni, “Gum obed ikomi, Daudi latina! Ibitiyo gin mapol, dok ibiloyogi ducu maber.” Ci Daudi ocito gire, ki Caulo bene odok i kabedone.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi obedo ikin jo Piliciti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Daudi olwodo lok ki i cwinye ni, “An ba, olo Caulo biketo cinge ikoma inino mo keken ci neka woko cut. Pieno gin maber ma omyero atim en aye me lwi woko me cito wa i lobo pa jo Piliciti; ci cwiny Caulo bia woko ikoma, pe dong biyenya ki iwang lobo pa jo Icrael, miyo abilaro kwona ki i cinge.” <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Daudi ocako a woko ki kunu, en ki jone miya abicel ma onongo gitye bote, ci gucito bot Akic wod pa Maok, rwot me Gat. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Daudi obedo ki Akic i Gat, en ki lwake ducu, kun dano acel acel ocito ki jo me ode. Daudi onongo otero mone aryo, Akinoam me Jejreel ki Abigail me Karmel, mayam obedo dako pa lyeli Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Ka kitito bot Caulo ni Daudi dong oringo woko wa i Gat, ci pe dok obedo kayenyo kore matwal.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Daudi dok owaco bot Akic ni, “Ka bedona boti oyomo cwinyi, ci wek kimiya kabedo mo ma ikin taun ma i loboni wek abed iye kunu. Pingo an latici abedo kwedi kacel i gang kali?” <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Ci Akic omiyo ki Daudi Jiklag, ma omiyo Jiklag odoko gang pa luker me Juda nio wa onyo. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Kare ma Daudi obedo kwede i lobo pa jo Piliciti oromo mwaka acel ki dwe angwen.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Ikare meno Daudi, ki jone gubedo kapoto mony ikom jo Gecur, jo Girij ki jo Amalek ma gin aye wegi lobo kunu cake wa con, guo kwede i Cur wa ki i Ejipt. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Ka Daudi omonyo lobo mo, en pe weko laco mo kadi dako mo ma dong makwo. Ci yako romi, dyangi, kana, kinaga wa ki bongi ka dwogo kwede bot Akic. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Kare ducu ka Akic openyo Daudi ni, “Tin icito kamonyo jo mene?” Ci Daudi gamo ni, “Kamonyo lobo Negeb matye i lobo Juda,” nyo ni, “Alwenyo ikom Negeb pa jo Jeramel,” nyo ni, “Amonyo Negeb pa jo Kenit.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Daudi pe oweko laco mo nyo dako mo obwot makwo, pien onongo olworo ni, gin bitito lok ma ikomwa, ni, “Daudi otimo gin ma onyo.” Meno aye obedo kite ikare ma obedo kwede i lobo pa jo Piliciti. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Akic obedo kageno Daudi kun tamo ni, “Jo tugi dong gidage matek tutwal, pieno en dong bibedo latica matwal.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Ikare meno jo Piliciti guoto monygi pi lweny ikom jo Icrael. Akic owaco bot Daudi ni, “Ber inge ni in ki joni wubicito kamony kacel kwedwa.” <verse eid="1SA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Daudi ogamo dog Akic ni, “Ber matek, ladita, dong ibingeyo gin ma atwero tiyone.” Akic dok owaco bot Daudi ni, “Abiketi ibedo lagwok kwona matwal.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Caulo olimo ajwaka lakor tipu i En-dor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 20:27">Lev 20:27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:10-11">Nwo 18:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 25:1">1 Cam 25:1</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare meno onongo Camuel dong oto woko. Jo Icrael ducu gukumu pire ci guyike i taun me Rama i gange kikome. Caulo onongo dong oryemo lukor tipu ki megi jogi woko ki i lobone.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Jo Piliciti gucoke ci gutongo gonygi i Cunem, Caulo bene ocoko jo Icrael ducu ci gin gutongo gonygi i Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Ka Caulo oneno mony pa jo Piliciti, ci obedo ki lworo, cwinye ocako myel matek. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 2:21">Wel 2:21</ref></char></note>Ka Caulo openyo dog Rwot, ci Rwot pe odoke iye lok mo, kadi wa ki lekgu, nyo ki Urim, nyo ki lok pa lunebi. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Ci Caulo owaco bot lutice ni, “Kong wuyenya dako mo ma lakor tipu, wek acit bote, apeny doge.” Lutice guwace ni, “Lakor tipu tye wa i En-dor.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Caulo oloko kit ruke woko mapat, pien oruku ginaruka mapat, ci ocako wot ki jone aryo. Gucito guo bot dakonu dyewor. Ci Caulo owaco bote ni, “Ber ikora tipu, ci mi jokki okela dano mo ma abitucu nyinge boti.” <verse eid="1SA 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Dako meno ogamo doge ni, “Ingeyo gin ma Caulo otiyo, kit ma oryemo kwede lukor tipu ki megi jogigu woko ki i lobone. Pingo in dok ibino ka cika ki owic me maka wek kineka woko?” <verse eid="1SA 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Ento Caulo okwongo kwong bote ki nying Rwot kun waco ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwoni, pe can mo bipoto ikomi pi lok man.” <verse eid="1SA 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Ci dako meno ogamo ni, “Abilwongo anga boti?” Ci Caulo ogamo ni, “Lwonga Camuel.” <verse eid="1SA 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Ka dako meno oneno kom Camuel, ci odange ki dwon matek, owaco bot Caulo ni, “Ibwola pingo? In i Caulo kikome.” <verse eid="1SA 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Ento Caulo owaco bot dakonu ni, “Pe ibed ki lworo. Ineno kom ango ka?” Dakonu ogamo ni, “Aneno tipu mo tye kabino kun kati a ki piny i ngom.” <verse eid="1SA 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Caulo dok openyo ni, “Kite nen ningning mono?” Ci dakonu ogamo ni, “Dano ma otii aye tye kabino; ma oumu kome woko ki jor.” Ci Caulo oniang ni en aye Camuel kikome, ci okulu wiye piny oryebe inyime.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Ci Camuel ocako lok ki Caulo kun waco ni, “Pingo iyela kit man me dwoka dok woko?” Ci Caulo ogamo ni, “Can aye tye odiya matek; pien jo Piliciti gitye kalweny ikoma. Lubanga bene otenya woko ata. Pe dong waca kit lok mo, kadi wa lok pa lunebi, kadi wa lekgu dong peke. En aye omiyo alwongi wek itita gin ma myero atim.” <verse eid="1SA 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Ci Camuel ogamo ni, “Pingo dok ipenyo an ma Rwot dong oweki wokoni, kun en dong odoko lameroki? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:28">1 Cam 15:28</ref></char></note>Rwot dong otimo ikomi kit mayam ocika kwede ci an bene atito loke boti wa con ca. Rwot dong oyeco keri woko okwanyo ki i cingi, ci dong otyeko miyone woko bot lawoti, en aye Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:3-9">1 Cam 15:3-9</ref></char></note>In yam pe iworo dog Rwot, pe icobo kiniga magwa pa Rwot ikom jo Amalek; en aye gin ma omiyo Rwot tye katimi kit man ikareni. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Rwot bimiyo jo Icrael ki in bene i cing jo Piliciti; diki in ki awobeni wubibedo kacel kweda. Rwot bimiyo mony pa jo Icrael i cing jo Piliciti.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Caulo otugi poto woko piny i ngom, ci obutu piny libat pi lworo ma omake matek pi lok pa Camuel. Tipu kome oto woko lirut, pien onongo pe ocamo cam mo i dyeceng ki dyewor meno ducu. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Dako meno ocito bot Caulo cok, ci oneno kit ma kome dong obange woko, ci owaco bote ni, “Nen ba ladit, an dong awinyo dogi, adyero pi kwona woko pi timo gin ma iwaca. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />In bene, ladit, dong iwiny doga. Wek kong aket latin cam mo inyimi icam, ka wek dok ilim kero pi wotwu.” <verse eid="1SA 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Ento Caulo okwero woko kun waco ni, “Pe abicam.” Ento lutice gubako doggi bote kacel ki dako meno, ci owinyo lokgi, ocako a malo ki i ngom obedo iwi kitanda. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Dako meno onongo tye ki latin roya mo ma opito ocwe. Ocako nekone woko oyotoyot, ka ojobo moko kwon, onywango, otedo mugati ma tobi pe iye. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Ci oketo cam inyim Caulo ki lutice ci gin gucamo, ka gua woko i dyewor meno gucito.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Piliciti gukwero Daudi woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Jo Piliciti gucoko monygi ducu i Apek; ki jo Icrael gutongo gonygi inget wang it matye i Jejreel. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Rwodi abic pa jo Piliciti gumol gukato ki monygi miya ki miya dok ki alip ki alip, ki Daudi ki jone bene gumol gukato lacen kacel ki Akic. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Ludito mony pa jo Piliciti gupenyo ni, “Jo Ibru gitye katimo gin ango kany?” Akic ogamo doggi kun waco ni, “Man aye Daudi mayam latic pa Caulo rwot me Icrael. En dong otyeko bedo kweda pi kare malac mada. Cake ki inino ma oringo olaro bota nio kwede wa onyo peya anongo roc mo ikome.” <verse eid="1SA 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Ento ludito mony pa jo Piliciti gubedo ki kiniga ikom Akic; guwace ni, “Cwal laco meno odok paco. Myero en odok cen i taun mayam imiyo bote. En pe bicito kwedwa i mony, miyo en biloke doko lamerokwa ki kunu. Ka nyeri mito dok ribe ki ladite, pe itamo ni en bineko jowa woko, ci coko wigi tero bote? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:7">1 Cam 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 21:11">21:11</ref></char></note>Man aye Daudi kikome, mayam kiwero kun mon gimyelo kwede ma kiwero ni, ‘Caulo oneko mere dano alip, ento Daudi oneko alip apar.’”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Ci Akic olwongo Daudi, owaco bote ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwoni in ibedo dano ma ageno. An aneno ni ber iwot kacel kwedwa i mony, pien pe anongo gin mo marac ikomi cake ki inino ma ibino iye bota nio wa onyo. Ento rwodi mukene pe gujoli. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Pieno ber itugi dok cen cut. Dok cen ki kuc, wek pe imii cwiny rwodi pa Lupiliciti obed ka cwer.” <verse eid="1SA 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Ci Daudi owaco bot Akic ni, “Ento an atimo gin ango? Gin ango ma inongo ikoma ladita, cake wa inino ma adonyo kwede i dog tici nio koni, mamiyo pe acito kalweny ki lumeroki, rwoda ma rwot?” <verse eid="1SA 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Ci Akic dok omedo dok iye ki Daudi ni, “Angeyo maber ni bal mo peke ikomi; ki inyima in icalo lamalaika pa Lubanga. Ento ludito monywa gutyeko waco ni, in pe ibicito kwedwa i mony. <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Kombedi dong itugi a ki odikoni, kacel ki joni ma iloyogi ma gubino kwedi. Cak wot ki i odikoni, a woko ki kany oyotoyot teke piny leng maromo wot.” <verse eid="1SA 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Daudi ocako a woko odiko con ki jone, ci odok i lobo pa jo Piliciti. Ento jo Piliciti gucito i Jejreel.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi oloyo jo Amalek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Daudi ki jone guo i Jiklag inino me adeke, ci gunongo jo Amalek gumonyo Negeb ki Jiklag. Guloyo Jiklag woko, guwango woko ki mac, <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />dok guyako mon ducu ki jami ducu matye kunu, wa dano ducu matino ki madito. Pe guneko dano mo gire, ento guterogi makwo, gucito kwedgi woko. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Ka Daudi ki jone guo i taun ci gunongo tye kawang awanga, dok mon gi ki awobegi ki anyiragi ducu kiterogi woko. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Daudi ki jone guwoo ki koko, nio ka tek me koko otum woko. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:42-43">1 Cam 25:42-43</ref></char></note>Mon pa Daudi aryoni bene kiterogi woko, Akinoam me Jejreel ki Abigail me Karmel, dako pa lyeli Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Piny oloyo Daudi woko matek, pien jone bene gubedo kalok pi cele woko ki got, pien cwinygi ducu obedo kec matek kun dano acel acel tamo pi awobene ki anyirane. Ento Daudi olimo tekcwiny ki bot Rwot Lubangane.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:20-23">1 Cam 22:20-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Daudi owaco bot ajwaka Abiatar wod pa Akimelek ni, “Kela epod.” Ci okelo bot Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Ci Daudi openyo dog Rwot ni, “Aryem kor mony man? Abimakogi woko i yoo?” Rwot odoke iye ni, “Ryem korgi, pien ibimakogi woko i yoo ada, dok ibilaro jowu.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Daudi ocako wot ki jone miya abiceli kacel kwede. Ka guo i kulu Becor, ci jo ma dong guol ma pe gitwero ngolo kulu gudong kenyo, gubedo iye. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Ento Daudi omede ka ryemo kor jo Amalek ki jone miya angwen kacel kwede, kun jo miya aryo ma komgi oloc, ma ngolo kulu oloyogi gudong cen.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Gunongo Laejipt mo i dye bar ci gukele bot Daudi. Gucako miye mugati ocamo, ka kimiye pii amata omato, <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />ka dok gumiye nucu pok otini mutwone ki tuga olok aryo mutwone. Ka dong otyeko cam ci cwinye odwogo; pien onongo pe ocamo cam mo kadi wa pii bene pe omato pi nino adek dyeceng ki dyewor. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Lacen Daudi ocako penye ni, “In kono i dano pa anga? Ia ki kwene?” En ogamo ni, “An wod jo Ejipt, latic pa La-amalek mo. Ladita otenya woko ata, pien onongo two aye omaka, ma arii kwede nino adek ma okatoni. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Wan wamonyo Negeb pa jo Keret, ki pa jo Juda, ki Negeb pa jo Kaleb, ka dok wawango Jiklag woko.” <verse eid="1SA 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Daudi openye ni, “In ibitera bot mony meno?” Awobinu ogamo ni, “Kong i kwonga kwong ki nying Lubanga kun iwaco ni pe ibineka, dok pe ibidwoka i cing ladita, ci abiteri bot monygi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Ci awobinu otero Daudi kunu, ikare ma guo ikabedo meno ononogi guket woko ata i kabedo meno ducu kun gicamo, gimate ki myelgu, ma cwinygi yom pi lwak jami ma guyako madwong ki i lobo pa jo Piliciti ki i lobo Juda. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Ci Daudi opoto ikomgi kwarpiny, olwenyo kwedgi nio wa otyeno. Dano mo ki ikin gi pe ma obwot makwo, kono nyo awobe miya angwen ma guito wi kinagagi, ci guringo kwede woko. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Daudi oyako gin ducu ma jo Amalek onongo guyako, ci olaro bene mone aryo ducu. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Gin mo peke ma orwenyo kadi wa gin matidi nyo madite; awobe ducu wa anyira ducu ki jami ma guyako ducu, ki gin mo keken ma jonu gutero, Daudi odwokogi ducu cen. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Daudi omayo wa dyegi ki romi ki dyangi ducu, ci jone guleko lim meno ducu inyimgi kun giwaco ni, “Man aye lim ma Daudi oyako.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Ka Daudi odwogo bot jo miya aryoni mayam komgi oloc woko ma pe dong gitwero lubu kore, ma onongo kiwekogi i dog kulu Becorni, ci jo meno gukato kajolo Daudi ki lwak ma gucito kwedeni. Ka Daudi onyiko cok, en bene omotogi. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Ci jo maracu ducu ki lutim aranyi ma ikin lwak ma gucito ki Daudi guwaco ni, “Joni pe gucito kwedwa, pieno wan pe wabimiyogi gin mo ikom jami ma wayako wadwogo kwedeni. Wek dano acel acel oter dakone ki lutinone ci guciti.” <verse eid="1SA 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Ento Daudi ogamo ni, “Pe wubitimo kitmeno utmegina, ikom gin ma Rwot omiyo botwa. Pien Rwot aye obedo ka gwokowa, ci otingo mony ma gubino kamonyowa, omiyogi i cingwa. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Anga matwero ye lokwu ikom lok man? Kit ma kipoko ki jami bot dano ma ocito i monyi, kibipoko bot dano ma gudong ka gwoko jami bene kitmeno. Kibipoko bot dano ducu marom.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Meno odoko cik matwal cake ikare meno, ma jo Icrael gibedo kalubu nio wa onyo.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Ka Daudi odwogo i Jiklag, ci ocwalo dul jami ma kiyakoni bot lureme ma gin ludongo pa jo Juda kun waco ni, “Motwu ene ma wayako ki bot lumerok pa Rwot.” <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Ocwalo jami pi jo ma i Betel, ki i Ramot ma i Negeb, i Jatir, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />i Aroer, i Cipmot, i Ectemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />ki i Rakal, bot jo ma bedo i taun pa jo Jeramel ki pa jo Kenit, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />bot jo ma i Korma, Boracan, Atak, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />Kebron ki i lwak kabedo ducu mayam Daudi ki jone gubedo kawire iye.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s1">To pa Caulo ki awobene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 10:1-12">1 Tek 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Ikare meno jo Piliciti gulwenyo ikom jo Icrael. Ci jo Icrael guringo woko ki inyim jo Piliciti, dok kinekogi iwi got Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Jo Piliciti guringo gudingo kor Caulo ki awobene, ci guneko Yonacan, Abinadab ki Malkicua, ma gin ducu awobe pa Caulo. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Lweny ogeto matek kama Caulo onongo tye iye, ci wegi atero gucele woko, guketo ret ikome marac adada. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Caulo owaco bot lating jami lwenye ni, “Wot pala lucwani woko, icoba kwede pil, wek jo ma pe kilirogini, ma gin pe ngeyo Lubanga, pe gubin ikoma gucoba, miyo giwuc ikoma.” Ento lating jami lwenye pe oye, pien lworo omake matek, omiyo Caulo okwanyo pala lucwane kikome opoto ogure kwede kekene. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Ka lating jami lweny oneno ni Caulo dong oto, en bene opoto ogure kekene ki pala lucwane, ci en onywako to ki Caulo kacel. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Kitmeno Caulo ki awobene adeki, ki lating jami lwenye, ki lwake ducu guto woko lawangacel inino acel. <verse eid="1SA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Ka jo Icrael ma onongo gitye loka nota tungcel, ki jo mukene ma onongo gitye loka Jordan, guneno ni mony pa jo Icrael guringo woko, dok ni Caulo ki awobene kinekogi woko, ci guringo guweko taun gi ducu woko; ci jo Piliciti gubino gucako bedo i taun magu ducu.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Orwone jo Piliciti gupuk odiko ka lunyu bongi ki ikom jo ma kinekogi, ci gunongo kom Caulo ki kom awobene adeki ikom got Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Gungolo wi Caulo woko, ka gulunyo jami lwenye ki ikome, ci gucwalo kwena oromo i lobo pa jo Piliciti ducu, pi tero lok me yomcwiny bot jogigi ki bot lwakgi ducu. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Guketo jami lweny pa Caulo i ot pa jokgi ma dako ma kilwongo ni Acitarot, ka dok guguru kome ikom cel murumu taun madit me Bet-can. <verse eid="1SA 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Ento ka jo ma gibedo i Jabec-gilead guwinyo gin ma jo Piliciti gutimo ikom Caulo, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />ci oteka lwenygi ducu gua, gucito guwoto dyewor benebene, gukwanyo kom Caulo ki kom awobene woko, ki ikom cel me Bet-can, guo kwedgi wa i Jabec, ci guwango komgi woko kunu. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Lacen gukwanyo cogogi, guyiko ite yat ananga matye i Jabec, ci gurii kec pi nino abiro.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>